<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha pili cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha pili cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Hitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli pa kutumbula chavili chitabu chivaha chechamanyikini ngati Chitabu cha Samweli. Pakutumbula chitabu chenichi chagavaniswi na kuvya hitabu hivili mu litoleo lelakemiwi Seputuaginti. Lenili lavili litoleo la kutumbula la tafusili ya Lilaganu la Kadeni kwa luga ya Chiyunani. Liina la tafusili yeniyo lavi na mana kuvya yayandikwi na vandu vasomi sabini amala sabini na vavili va Chiyawudi. Mutafusili ya Chigiliki, hitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vyakemiwi 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi, na mu litoleo la Chilatini lelagelekili, hitabu yeniyo yang'anamwiki na kukemiwa 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi. Hinu hitabu yeyimanyikana lelu iyi ngati 1 Vankosi na 2 Vankosi vyakemiwi 3 Vankosi na 4 Vankosi. Chitabu cha 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vikokosa wumi wa mlota Samweli na nkosi Sauli na nkosi Daudi. Samweli avii chilongosi wa mwishu lukumbi mulima wa Izilaeli pewabadiliswi kuhuma kutalaliwa na vahamula na kutumbula kutalaliwa na vankosi. Samweli ndi mweavayitalili mahuta Sauli na Daudi kuvakita vavya vankosi va kutumbula va Izilaeli. Hitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vidandawula histoliya ya mulima wa Isilaeli lukumbi lwenulo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kawaka mundu mweamanyili yani mweayandiki chitabu cha 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli. Muyandika ajiluwili lepi mwene mu chitabu chenichi, nambu pangi avii mumi lukumbi lwoha lwa ulongosi wa nkosi Daudi, na pangi asigalili mumi hati pawapitili ulongosi wenuwo, ndi pangi yihotoleka ahotwili kugawona na kusoma mayandiku gangia gegadandawili wumi wa Sauli na Samweli. Ndava muni yimanyikana lepi mundu amala vandu vevayandiki hitabu yeniyi, mewa yimanyikana lepi hitabu yeniyi yayandikwi ndali.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavili mugati</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 1-5 zilangisa Daudi cheavili nkosi wa ku Yuda, na baadayi akavya nkosi wa Izilaeli yoha.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 6-10 zilangisa Daudi cheatalalili ngati nkosi, na kuvahotola vamakoko vaki vamahele.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 11-12 zilangisa Daudi cheabudili kwa kukita ukemi na kukoma, na chaalakaliwi na mlota Natani.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 13-20 zilangisa Daudi cheabelaliwi na vandu va kutumbula na vandu va pili.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 21-24 zidandawula mambu ga mwishu ga utalalila wa Daudi ngati nkosi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi imanyiswa lifwa la Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Peamali kufwa Sauli, Daudi akawuya peavahotwili Vaamaleki, akatama ku Sikilagi kwa lukumbi lwa magono gavili. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Ligono la datu, abweli mundu mmonga kuhuma mu kambi ya Sauli, kuni apapwili nyula zaki na kujiyitila lububu kumutu waki. Mundu mwenuyo akahamba kwa Daudi, akajitaga pamagendelu ga Daudi cha kumtopesa. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi akamjovela, “Uhuma kwoki?” Na mwene akamyangula, “Nitolwiki kuhuma ku kambi ya Vaisilaeli.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi akamkota, “Mambu gavii wuli kwenuko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Mundu yula kamjovela, “Manjolinjoli vitu vatili ngondo na vamahele vakomiwi. Mewawa Sauli pamonga na mwana waki Yonatani vakomiwi.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi akamkota msongolo yula, “Umanyi wuli kuvya Sauli na Yonatani mwana waki vakomiwi?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Msongolo yula akamuyangula, “Nangipu yene penavili kuchitumbi cha Giliboa. Namuweni Sauli ayegamili mgoha waki kuni vakwela falasi va vamakoko vaki vevamjumbisayi na mutuka zavi vamuhegalili neju. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Sauli peang'anamwiki kulo mumbele, aniwene, akanikemela. Na nene nikamuyidakila, ‘Ena mkulu, nivii apa!’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Mwene anikotili ‘Veve ndi wayani?’ Nikamuyangula, ‘Nene ndi Muamaleki.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Penapo akanijovela, ‘Hegelela unikoma muni nilemiswi neju na mvinisu ndi uvaha neju, nambu nakona nivii mumi.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Penapo ndi nikamuhambila, nikamkoma, ndava namanyili kuvya akagwayi pahi yati ihotola lepi kuvya mumi. Ndi nikatola njingwa ya chinkosi yeyavili kumutu waki na bangili yeawali muchiwoko chaki, vyoha nikuletili veve, bambu wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daudi akapapula nyula zaki cha ungolongondi. Hati vandu vevavi pamonga na Daudi vakakita chichocho. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Vakavembeneka na vakavemba ndava ya kukomiwa kwa Sauli na Yonatani mwana waki, na ndava ya Vaisilaeli, vandu va Bambu Chapanga. Vakajihinisa changali kulya mbaka kimihi muni vandu vamahele vavii vakomiwi kungondo.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi akamkota msongolo yula mweamletili ujumbi, “Uhumalili kwoki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Mwene akayangula, “Nene ndi Muamaleki, nitama pamulima waku ngati muyehe.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi akamkota, “Ndava kyani veve wayogwipi lepi kumkoma mundu mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga kwa kunyalwa mahuta?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Kangi, Daudi akamkemela mmonga wa vasongolo vaki akamjovela, “Mkoma mundu uyu!” Msongolo yula akatola upanga akamuhoma na kumkoma Muamaleki yula. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi akajova, “Ujiletili lifwa laku wamwene, muni ujovili wamwene kwa mlomo waku kuvya, ‘Nimkomili mundu mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga kwa kunyalwa mahuta.’”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi ivembeneka ndava ya lifwa la Sauli na Yonatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi ayimbili lunyimbu lwa kuvavembenekela Sauli na Yonatani mwana waki. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Daudi akalagiza vandu va ku Yuda vawuliwa lunyimbu lwenulo, na lunyimbu lwenulo luyandikwi mu chitabu cha Yashali. Daudi ayimbili lunyimbu lwenulo naha.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />Veve Isilaeli, vandu veukujimekela na ukuvahekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">vakomiwi pa chitumbi chaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Lola vakekesi chevawili!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Lijambu lenilo mkotoka kuvajovela vandu va muji wa Gati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">amala mu senda za Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Ngati lepi naha, vadala vafilisiti yati viluluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">vasikana va vandu venavo vangadumula jandu yati vihekelela.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Nyenye vitumbi vya Giliboa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">mkotoka kuvya na mbetu amala fula kwinu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Amala migunda yinu magono goha hikotoka kupambika chindu chochoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Muni kwenuko chingwamba cha mkekesi chagwili pahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">chingwamba cha Sauli chatopiswi lepi.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Ndava ya ngasi ya vandu vevakomiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">na ndava ya higa za vala vakekesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Yonatani avii mundu mweilunga bwina kwa upinde waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">upanga wa Sauli wakomili vandu vamahele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">lukumbi lwoha zakomili vandu vamahele.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 1:22" />
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Chakaka zakomili vakekesi.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Sauli na Yonatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">vaganiwi na vandu na kuvahekelela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Pevavili mumi, vatamili pamonga na pevafwili, vafwi pamonga.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 1:23" />
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Vavili yeywa kuliku namanyanga, vana makakala kuliku lihimba.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Nyenye vadala va Isilaeli mumvembela Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">Avawaliki nyenye nyula zidung'u zabwina za mashonga gamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">atotalili mampambu ga zahabu mu nyula zinu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Lola vandu vakekesi chevafwili!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Vafwili pevavi mukutovana ku ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonatani afwi ku hitumbi.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Nivi ngolongondi ndava yaku, mlongo wangu Yonatani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Magono goha waniganili neju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">uganu waku kwa nene wavi uvaha neju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">kuliku mdala cheakumgana mgana waki.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Lola vakekesi chevafwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">na vindu vyavi vya ngondo vyasigalili changali lihengu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ivikwa kuvya nkosi wa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Pagamaliki mambu genago, Daudi akamyupa Bambu Chapanga, akajova, “Wu, nihamba kuutola muji umonga wa miji ya Yuda?” Bambu Chapanga akamjovela, “Hamba!” Daudi akamkota, “Nihamba kuutola muji woki?” Bambu Chapanga akamyangula, “Hamba ukautola muji wa Hebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Hinu, Daudi akahamba ku Hebuloni, pamonga na vadala vaki vavili, Ahinoamu mweahumali ku mulima wa Yezeleli na Abigaili lipwela wa Nabali, mweahumalili ku muji wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Mewawa Daudi avatolili vandu vaki, pamonga na vandu va munyumba zavi, na vene vakatama mumiji yeyavili mumihana ya Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Ndi vandu va ku Yuda vamuhambili Daudi ku Hebuloni vakamnyala mahuta muni avya nkosi wavi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Daudi peayuwini kuvya vandu va ku Yabeshi Gileadi ndi vevamzikili Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />avatumili vandu ku Yabeshi Gileadi na ujumbi weujova, “Bambu Chapanga avamotisa muni mwalangisi usadikika kwa kumzika Sauli nkosi winu. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Hinu, Bambu Chapanga avalangisa uganu waki wangali na mwisu na usadikika waki kwinu. Na nene yati nikuvakitila mambu gabwina ndava ya genago gemwakitili. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Hinu mkangamala na muvya vakekesi! Nkosi winu Sauli afwili na vandu va ku Yuda vaninyalili mahuta nivya nkosi wavi.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti ihaguliwa kuvya nkosi wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abineli mwana wa Neli, mkulu wa manjolinjoli va Sauli, avii amtolili Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli na kumpeleka ku Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Kwenuko, Abineli akamkita Ishibosheti kuvya nkosi wa ku Gileadi na ku Asheli na ku Yezeeli na ku Efulaimu na ku Benjamini na mulima woha wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli avili na miyaka alubaini peatumbwili kuyitalalila Isilaeli, na mwene alongwisi kwa miyaka hivili. Nambu likabila la Yuda lamlandili Daudi ngati nkosi wavi.<verse eid="2SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daudi avili nkosi wa likabila la Yuda kwa miyaka saba na miyehi sita, na mwene atalalili kuni itama ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va Izilaeli na vandu va Yuda vitovana ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abineli mwana wa Neli pamonga na manjolinjoli va Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli, vakawuka ku Mahanaimu na kuhamba ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mwana wa Seluya na manjolinjoli va Daudi, na vene vakawuka kuhamba kukonganeka na Abineli na vandu veavili navu ku litanda lelivili ku Gibeoni. Msambi umonga wavii ku upandi umonga wa litanda na msambi wungi upandi wungi. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abineli akamjovela Yoabu, “Valeka vasongolo vatovana palongolo yitu!” Yoabu akamyangula, “Ena.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Hinu manjolinjoli kumi na vavili vevahambili ndava ya Ehibosheti na likabila la Benjamini, vakomini na manjolinjoli kumi na vavili va Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Kila mmonga amkamwili mutu mundu mweitovana nayu, akamuhoma upanga mu luvau ndi vasongolo voha vavili vakagwa pahi, vakafwa. Pandu penapo pikemiwa Helikati Hazulimu mana yaki luvanja lwa upanga ku Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Kangi manjolinjoli voha vakatumbula kutovana, pandi zoha zivili vatovini chi makakala. Ngondo ya ligono lenilo yavili yivaha neju, nambu manjolinjoli va Daudi vambunili Abineli na manjolinjoli va Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Vana vadatu va Seluya, Yoabu na Abishai na Asaheli vavili penapo. Asaheli avii na uhotola wa kujumba ngati ngolombo. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asaheli amvingisini Abineli changali kung'anamuka kumangiha amala upandi wa kulyela. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abineli peanga'anamwiki na kulola mumbele na kumlola Asaheli, amjovili, “Wu, ndi veve Asaheli?” Mwene akamyangula, “Ena, ndi nene.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abineli akamjovela Asaheli, “Kotoka kunijumbisa, ng'anamukila kumangenya amala upandi wa kulyela, umkoma linjolinjoli mmonga na utola vindu vyaki.” Nambu Asaheli alekili lepi kumvingisana. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abineli akamjovela Asaheli mala ya pili, “Leka kunivingisa. Ndava kyani ukuning'ang'anisa nikukomayi? Yati nivengana na Yoabu muhaja waku?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Nambu Asaheli akabela kung'anamuka. Hinu Abineli akamuhoma Asaheli kwa mgoha mulutumbu na ukahumila kumgongo. Asaheli akagwa pahi, na kufwa bahopa. Vandu voha pavahikili pafwilili Asaheli vakayima.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Nambu Yoabu na Abishai vamlandili Abineli. Lilanga palatipamayi, vahikili ku chitumbi cha Ama, weuvili kwelihumila lilanga mwa Gia, ku njila yeyihamba kulukongolo lwa Gibioni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Vandu va likabila la Benyamini vakonganiki pamonga na kuwungana na Abineli, na vene vakakwela panani ya Chitumbi tayali kwa ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Kangi Abineli akamkemela Yoabu, “Wu yati titovana magono goha? Wu ulola lepi mwishu waki uvya mvinisu? Tete tavalongo wu ndi ndali yati ukuvalagiza vandu vaku valeka kutivingisana?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu akamjovela, “Nilapa kwa Chapanga mweavi mumi, kuvya ngaukotoka kujova lijambu lenilo, chakaka vandu vangu ngavayendalili kuvavingisana valongo vavi mbaka chilau lukela.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Hinu, Yoabu akapyula lipenenga na vandu vakaleka kuvavingisa vandu va Isilaeli, na ngondo yikamalika ligono lenilo.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abineli na vandu vaki vagendili mu likemba la mfuleni Yoludani kilukilu. Vakayomboka mfuleni Yoludani, vakagenda muhi woha mbaka vakahika ku Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu peawuyili kuhuma kumlanda Abineli, avakemili vandu voha, akamanya kuvya manjolinjoli kumi na tisa va Daudi pamonga na Asaheli vavii lepi. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Nambu manjolinjoli va Daudi vavakomili vandu miya zidatu na sitini va likabila la Benyamini vevavii pamonga na Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na vandu vaki vatolili higa ya Asaheli, vauzikili mulitinda la vandu va munyumba yaki, lelivi ku Betelehemu. Kangi vagendili kilukilu, na kwapachili vahikili ku muji wa Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Kwavili na ngondo magono gamahele pagati ya vandu vevawungini na vandu va munyumba ya Sauli, na vala vevawungini na Daudi. Daudi ayendalili kupata makakala, nambu upandi wa Sauli wayendalili kupunguka makakala.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vagosi va Daudi vevavelekiwi ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Vana vevavelekiwi kwa Daudi vavi, Amnoni ndi mveleka waki wa kutumbula, nyina waki avi Ahinohamu mweahumalili ku Yezeeli, <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Kileabu avi mvelekwa wa pili, nyina waki avi Abigaili, lipwela la Nabali mweahumalili ku Kalimeli na Abisalomu avi mvelekwa waki wa datu, nyina waki avi Maaka, msikana wa Talimai nkosi wa Geshuli, <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Adoniya mvelekwa waki wa mcheche, nyina waki akemiwa Hagiti, na Shefatia mvelekwa waki wa muhanu, nyina waki akemiwa Abitali, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />na Isilimu, mvelekwa waki wa sita, nyina waki akemiwi Egila. Daudi aveleki vana vagosi voha ava peavili ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli akujiwunga na Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Ngondo payayendalili pagati ya vandu va Daudi na vandu va munyumba ya Sauli, Abineli ayendalili kuvya na makaka neju pagati ya vandu va munyumba ya Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli peavili mumi avii na mdala wa kuvala mmonga mwaikemiwa Lisipa msikana wa Aiya. Hinu ligono limonga Ishibosheti akamkota Abineli, “Ndava kyani ugonili na mdala wa kuvala wa dadi wangu?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineli akayoma neju ndava ya malovi ga Ishibosheti, akajova, “Wu, uholalela nene nihotola kumng'anamukila Sauli na kuuhengela mulima wa Yuda? Wu, uholalela nene nikuvahengela vandu va lukolo lwa Yuda? Lola, nene nikumyidakila dadi waku Sauli, na valongo vaki na vamkozi vaki na nikuyungili ukotoka kubuniwa na Daudi mbaka lelu. Pamonga na genago goha lelu ukuniwona nene kuvya nibudili ndava ya mdala mwenuyu. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Chapanga anibuna ngati yati nikita lepi mambu goha Chapanga geamuahidili Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Bambu Chapanga amlapalili Daudi kuvya akuutola unkosi kuhuma mulukolo lwa Sauli na kumpela mwene. Na mwene yati ilongosa Isilaeli na Yuda kuhuma ku Dani mbaka ku Belisheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti alingili lepi kumyangula chochoha, muni amyogopa neju Abineli.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Hinu, Abineli akavatuma vajumbi kwa Daudi, ku Hebuloni vakamjovela, “Wu, mweanamakakala ga kuutalalila mulima uwu ndi yani? Kita lilaganu na nene, na nene yati nikutangatila uyitalalila Isilaeli yoha.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi akamyangula, “Chabwina, yati nikita lilaganu na veve. Nambu nikuyupa chindu chimonga, peubwela uganikiwa uniletela hoti mdala wangu Mikali msikana wa Sauli, na penapo ndi yati niyidakilana na veve.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Mewa Daudi atumili vajumbi kwa Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli kujova, “Niwuyasila mdala wangu Mikali mwenamgegili kwa posa ya makumba miya yimonga ga mahona ga Vafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Hinu, Ishibosheti atumili vandu vakamtola Mikali kuhuma kwa Palitieli mngana waki, mwana wa Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Nambu Palitieli akahamba pamonga na mdala waki kuni ipita kuvemba njila yoha mbaka ku Bahulimu. Abineli akamjovela Palitieli, “Wuya kunyumba.” Na mwene akawuya.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abineli alongili na vagogo va Isilaeli, akavajovela, “Mulukumbi lutali mwaganayi neju Daudi avya nkosi winu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Hinu mukita lijambu lenilo, muni Bambu Chapanga amulapalili Daudi kwa kujova, ‘Kupitila veve Daudi mtumisi wangu, yati nikuvasangula vandu vangu va Isilaeli kuhuma mumawoko ga Vafilisiti na yati nikuvasangula kuhuma kwa vamakoko vavi vangi.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abineli na mwene mewa alongili na vandu va likabila la Benyamini, kangi akahamba mbaka ku Hebuloni kumjovela Daudi kuvala gala goha gevayidakilini kukita vandu voha va Isilaeli na vandu voha va likabila la Benjamini.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abineli peahambi kwa Daudi kula ku Hebuloni ahambili na vandu ishilini, na Daudi akavakitila mselebuko. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abineli akamjovela Daudi, “Nene yati nihamba kuvakonganesa vandu voha va Isilaeli ndava yaku veve bambu wangu nkosi, ndava vahotola kukita lilaganu na veve muni uvya nkosi wavi, na veve yati ukuvatalalila voha ngati chaugana.” Penapo Daudi akamlaga Abineli muni ahamba, na mwene akahamba cha uteke.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu akumkoma Abineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Daudi peamalili ndu kumlaga Abuneli ahamba cha uteke, Yoabu na vandu vangi va Daudi vawuyili kuhuma ku ngondo, kuni vagegili vindu vyamahele vyevatolili. Hinu Abineli avili lepi pamonga na Daudi ku Hebuloni muni Daudi amali kumlanga na kuhamba. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu peawuyili pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki voha, vandu vakamjovela kuvya Abineli mwana wa Neli abwelili kumlola nkosi Daudi, na mwene amlekili ahambayi cha uteke. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Yoabu akamuhambila nkosi na kumjovela, “Hinu ukiti kyani? Lola Abineli abweli kwaku, ndava kyani umleki ahambayi? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Wu, umanyi lepi kuvya Abineli mwana wa Neli abweli kukukonga? Abwelili kulolokesa mipangu yaku na gala geukita.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu peahumili kulongela na Daudi, akatuma vajumbi vamulandayi Abineli, na vene vamkolili pa chiliva cha Sila, vakamuwuyisa, nambu Daudi amanyi lepi lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abineli peawuyili ku Hebuloni, Yoabu amkemili pamuhana ya limlyangu ngati igana kulongela nayu chimfiyu. Yoabu akamuhoma Abineli mgoha pa lutumbu muni amkomili Asaheli mwavi mlongo waki, na Abineli akafwa. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Mwanakandahi Daudi payuwini mambu ago akajova, “Nene na unkosi wangu Chapanga amanyili kuvya tihokili lepi kuvala ngasi ya Abineli mwana wa Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Kubuda kwa kukomiwa kwa Abuneli kuvya panani ya Yoabu na vandu va dadi waki! Vandu va Yoabu vavya na utamu wa chisonono, na utamu wa mabudi amala mwaigendela mkongojo, amala kukomiwa kwa upanga, amala vakosa chakulya.” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu na mlongo waki Abishani vamkomili Abineli muni amkomi mlongo wavi Asaheli lukumbi lwa ngondo ku Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli izikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Kangi, nkosi Daudi akamlagiza Yoabu na vala vevavi pamonga nayu, vapapula nyula zavi, vawala magunila ndava ya kumvembenekela Abineli. Lukumbi lwa kumzika Abineli, nkosi Daudi agendayi mumbele ya vandu vevagegili higa ya Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abineli azikiwi ku Hebuloni na nkosi amvembenikili kwa lwami pamuhana ya litinda, kangi vandu voha na vene mewa vakavemba. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Daudi ayimbili lunyimbu ulu lwa kumvembenekela Abineli, akajova, “Yivi wuli mbaka Abineli kufwa ngati mundu mweahimwiki?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Mawoko gaku gakungiwi lepi na magendelu gaku gakungiwi lepi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Ufwi ngati mundu muhakau!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:34" />
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Vandu voha vamvembenikili.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Daudi abelili kulya chakulya ligono loha la malilu, hinu vandu voha vahambili kumyupa Daudi alya chakulya, nambu Daudi alapili akavajovela, “Chapanga anikoma ngati yati nilya chakulya amala chindu chochoha kwakona lilanga langatipama.” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Vandu voha vagaweni mambu genago vakaganiswa. Vandu vaganiswi na kila chindu cheakitili nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Hinu ligono lenilo Vaisilaeli voha vamanyili kuvya nkosi Daudi awungini lepi na Yoabu kumkoma Abineli mwana wa Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Nkosi Daudi akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Wu, mmanyili lepi kuvya lelu mundu mkulu na mweimanyikana afwili pa Isilaeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Hati ngati nene na nkosi mweninyunyiziwi mahuta na Bambu Chapanga, lelu nikujiwona nina makakala lepi. Vana ava va Seluya vakuning'aha. Bambu Chapanga avahamula vandu venava vahakau ndava ya uhakau wevakitili!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti ikomiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli, peayuwini kuvya Abineli akomiwi ku Hebuloni, adenyiki mtima na vandu voha va Isilaeli vakavya na wogoyi. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli, avili na vandu vavili vevavili vachilongosi va msambi wa kuzangila, mmonga akewa Bana na yungi akemewa Lekabu. Venavo vavi vana va Limoni, mundu wa likabila la Benjamini kuhuma ku muji wa Beloti, ndava munji wa Beloti mewa wavili pandu pa mulima wa vandu va likabila la Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Vakolonjinji vevatama mu muji wa Beloti vatilalili ku Gitaimu, na vitama kwenuko ngati vayehe mbaka lelu.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Mvelekwa yungi wa Sauli avili Mefibosheti mwana wa Yonatani. Sauli na Yonatani dadi waki pevakomiwi, mwene avili na myaka muhanu. Mdala mweamulelayi peayuwini kuvala kufwa kwavi kuhuma ku muji wa Yezileeli, akamtola na kutila nayu. Nambu peakitayi kanyata kutila nayu, akamgwisa pahi mwana mwenuyo, akavya mweangahotola kugenda.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Lekabu na Baana vana va Limoni mweihumila ku Beloti, vakahamba ku nyumba ya Ishibosheti. Vahikili kwenuko muhi, Ishibosheti peavi apumulili ku nyumba yaki. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Mlonda wa limyangu mweapetayi nganu agonili lugono. Penapo Lekabu na Bana vakayingila mugati. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Pevahikili mugati mwenumo vamkolili Ishibosheti agonili tipitipi pa chitanda chaki, vakamkoma. Pevamali kumkoma, vakamdumula mutu na kuwuka nawu. Vakagenda kilukilu kupita mu likemba la mfuleni Yoludani. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Kangi vakatola mutu wa Ishibosheti na kumpelekela Daudi ku Hebuloni. Vakamjovela nkosi Daudi, “Wenuwu ndi mutu wa Ishibosheti mwana wa likoko waku Sauli mwealingili kukukoma. Bambu Chapanga akulipisili bambu wangu nkosi ndava ya Sauli na vachiveleku vaki.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Nambu Daudi akavayangula Lekabu na Baana, vana va Limoni wa ku Beloti, akajova, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavi mumi mweanisangwili kuhuma kwa vamakoko vangu voha. <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Mundu yula mweabwelili na kunijovela kuvya Sauli afwili, aholalili akunijovela mambu gabwina, namkamwili na kumkoma. Yeniyo ndi yavii njombi yenampelili ndava ya ujumbi waki weaholalili wabwina kwa nene. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Wu, mundu muhakau akamkoma mundu wabwina pa chitanda, mu nyumba yaki, chabwina lepi kwa nene kumlipisila ndava ya kuyita ngasi kwaki kwa kumkoma na kumuwusa pa mulima?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Daudi akavalagiza manjolinjoli vaki vavakoma Lekabu na Baana. Vakavadumula mawoko gavi na magendelu gavi. Kangi vakayinjisa higa zavi mu mkongo pamuhana ya litanda ku Hebuloni. Nambu vatolili mutu wa Ishibosheti na kuzika mulitinda la Abineli ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ivya nkosi wa Isilaeli na Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1 Lus 11:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Hinu makabila goha ga Isilaeli gamuhambili Daudi ku Hebuloni, na kumjovela, “Lola, tete ndi tavalongo vaku va gogo mmonga. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Kadeni apo, Sauli peavili nkosi witu, veve ndi mwewavalongosa Vaisilaeli ku ngondo, na Bambu Chapanga ahaidili kuvya, ‘Yati ukuvayunga vandu vangu Vaizilaeli na yati uvya chilongosi wavi.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Hinu vagogo voha va Isilaeli vakamuhambila nkosi Daudi ku Hebuloni, na mwene akakita lilaganu navu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, kangi vakamnyala mahuta Daudi avya nkosi wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi avili na miyaka selasini peavii atumbwili kutalalila, na atalalili kwa miyaka alubaini. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ku Hebuloni kwenuko, avatalalili vandu va Yuda kwa miyaka saba na miyehi sita, na ku Yelusalemu avatalalili vandu va Isilaeli pamonga na vandu va Yuda kwa miyaka selasini na hidatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Ligono limonga nkosi Daudi na vandu vaki vahambili ku Yelusalemu kuvazangila Vayebusi vevavili vakolonjinji va mulima wenuwo. Nambu Vayebusi venavo vakamvevesa kuni vijova, “Yati uyingila lepi mu muji uwu, muni hati vangalola na vevavi na chilema yati vakupingalila.” Vamjovili chenicho muni vaholalili kuvya Daudi ngahotwili lepi kuyingila mu muji wenuwo. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Nambu Daudi autolili muji wa Siyoni weutindisiwi luwumba lwa maganga, ndi wakemiwi muji wa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Ligono lenilo Daudi avajovili vandu vaki, “Mundu yoyoha mweakuvatova Vayebusi, apitila mumkingisa wa manji muni akavabuna vevanavilema na vangalola muni mpungu wangu ukuvavenga.” Ndi mana vandu vijova, “Vangalola na vevanachilema yati viyingia lepi mu nyumba ya chinkosi.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi atamili mungomi yeniyo, na mwene aukemili muji wenuwo, “Muji wa Daudi.” Daudi akamemesa ludaka pandu pepavii na likemba kutumbula kwelihumila lilanga kuhambila mgati ya muji. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Na mwene Daudi akayongaseka neju kuvya na makakala ndava muni Bambu Chapanga wa manjolinjoli ga kunani, avi pamonga naku.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Kangi, nkosi Hilamu wa ku Tilo atumili vajumbi kwa Daudi, mewa ampelekili mikongo ya mielezi na vafundi selemala na vajengaji vevamujengili Daudi nyumba ya chinkosi. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Hinu Daudi akamanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga amkangamalisi avya nkosi wa ku Isilaeli, na kuukita unkosi waki uvya uvaha ndava ya vandu vaki va ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daudi peahumili ku Hebuloni na kubwela pa Yelusalemu, agegili vadala vamahele, mewa avii na vadala va kuvala vamahele vevamvelekili vana vamahele vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Genaga ndi mahina ga vana vagosi va Daudi vevavelikwi ku Yelusalemu, Shamua na Shobahu na Natani na Solomoni, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />na Ibihali na Elishua na Nefegi na Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />na Elishama na Eliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akuvahotola Vafilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Lus 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Vasilisiti pevayuwini kuvya Daudi anyaliwi mahuta avya nkosi wa Isilaeli, vawukili vakahamba kumlonda muni vamkamulayi, nambu Daudi ayuwini kuvya vakumlonda, akahelela akahamba kujihiha mugati ya ngome. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Vafilisiti vahikili na kuvika kambi mu likemba loha la Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Hinu Daudi amkotili Bambu Chapanga, “Wu, nihambayi kuvazangila Vafilisiti? Wu, yati ukunitangatila nivahotola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Bambu Chapanga akamyangula Daudi, “Hamba ukavatova, muni chakaka yati nikukita uvahotola.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Hinu Daudi akahamba mbaka ku Baali Pelasimu, na kuvahotola Vafilisiti. Kangi akajova, “Bambu Chapanga apitili pagati ya makoko vangu ngati manji gamahele ga chihuku chegijumba.” Hinu pandu pala pakemiwi Baali Pelasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Vafilisiti vatilili vakahileka himong'omong'o yavi ya michapanga pandu penapo, ndi Daudi na vandu vaki vakahitola.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Vafilisiti vawuyili kangi na kuvika kambi mu likemba la Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi amkotili Bambu Chapanga, na mwene akamyangula, “Kotoka kuvazangila kuhumila penapo peuvili, nambu uvatindila cha mumbele na kuvazangila kuhumila upandi wungi kulongolo ya mikongo ya mifalafalaji. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Pemuyuwanayi lwami ngati vigigi vya magendelu kuhuma kunani ya mifalafalaji yeniyo, penapo muhamba kanyata, muni wenuwo yati wivya ulangisu kuvya nilongolili palongolo yinu kuvatova manjolinjoli va Vafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi akitili ngati chealagizwi na Bambu Chapanga, na mwene akavatova Vafilisiti kuhuma ku Geba mbaka ku Gezeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akulipeleka Lisanduku la Lilaganu ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Lus 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25">15:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:6">16:6</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 16:43">43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Daudi avakonganisi kangi manjolinjoli vakekesi elufu selasini vevamanyi kutova ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Daudi awukili na vandu vaki vakahamba ku Baali Yuda kulitola Lisandu la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, lelikemiwa kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga mweanamakakala, mwaitama pa chigoda chaki cha unkosi panani ya viumbi vyevivi na magwaba. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Hinu, vakalitola Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga kuhuma mu nyumba ya Abinadabu yeyavili ku chitumbi, vakalivika panani ya mutuka yamupya ya kuhutwa na falasi. Uza na Ahio vana va Abinadabu valongosayi mutuka yeniyo, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />Ahio agendayi palongolo ya lisanduku lenilo. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na vandu voha va Isilaeli, vakayimba na kukina kwa makakala gavi goha palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Vatovili ng'oma zezatenganizwi kwa mvinje, lilimba na kanjeke na ng'oma na liseve na matoazi.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Pavahikili paluvanja lwa kupepetela mabenu lwa ku Nakoni, Uza akalikamula Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Chapanga muni ng'ombi zila zakuvandwiki. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Bahopo ligoga la Bambu Chapanga likavya ndava ya Uza. Chapanga akamkoma balapala. Uza akafwa pamuhana ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Daudi ayomili muni Bambu Chapanga amkomili Uza ndava ya ligoga. Ndi pandu pala pikemiwa Pelesi Uza mbaka lelu.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Ligono lenilo Daudi amyogwipe Bambu Chapanga, akajova, “Hinu nene yati nihotola wuli kulitola na kutama nalu Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Hinu Daudi apeliki lepi Lisanduku la Lilaganu ku muji wa Daudi, nambu alipeliki ku nyumba ya Obedi Edomu, mundu wa muji wa Giti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Lisanduku lenilo la Bambu Chapanga latamili ku nyumba ya Obedi Edomu kwa lukumbi lwa miyehi hidatu, ndi Chapanga akammotisa Obedi Edomu pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Nkosi Daudi peayuwini kuvya Chapanga ammotisi Obedi Edomu pamonga vindu vyoha vyeavi navyu ndava ya Lisanduku la Chapanga, akahamba kulitola Lisanduku la Lilaganu mu nyumba ya Obedi Edomu na kulipeleka ku muji wa Daudi kwa sangaluka. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Vandu vala vevagegi Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga pevagendili hatuwa sita, Daudi akavayimamisa, akawusa teta ya kutinyiswa ng'ombi yigosi na mpapakasi mweakulupili. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi akinili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kwa makakala gaki goha kuni awalili kagwanda kahupi ka chimteta. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Hinu, mwene na Vaisilaeli voha valipeliki Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga ku muji wa Daudi kwa sangaluka na kwa kupula mapenenga.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga pelayingila mu muji wa Daudi, Mikali msikana wa Sauli alingulili pa lidilisha amuweni nkosi Daudi ihumbahumba na kukina palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, ndi akamvevesa mu mtima waki. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Kangi vayingisi Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga mugati ya lindada lealiyimiki Daudi na kulivika pandu paki. Ndi Daudi akawusa luteta lwa kutinyisa na luteta lwa uteke palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Daudi peamali kuwusa luteta lwa kutinyisa na luteta lwa uteke, akavamotisa vandu kwa lihina la Bambu Chapanga mweavi na makakala goha. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Mewa akavagavanisila yakulya vandu voha vagosi na vadala, kila mundu akampela chipandi cha nyama na libumunda na libumunda la zabibu ziyumu. Ndi vandu voha vakawuka, kila mundu akawuya ku nyumba yaki.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Daudi peawuyili ku nyumba yaki ndava ya kuvamotisa vandu va mu nyumba yaki, Mikali msikana wa Sauli akahuma kuvala, akahamba kumpokela, akamjovela cha kumvevesa, “Lola lelu nkosi wa Isilaeli cheajipelili soni kwa kujigubukula nyula zaki palongolo ya vatumisi vaki vagosi na vadala ngati mundu mweahimwiki chaihula nyula zaki palongolo ya vandu changali kuwona soni.”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi akamjovela Mikali, “Nikalikina paongolo ya Bambu Chapanga mweanihagwili nene na kumleka dadi waku na vandu va munyumba yaki. Anikitili nivya mtalalila wa vandu vaki va Izilaeli. Hinu nene yati niyendelela kukina ndava ya kumtopesa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Yati nikujihelesa neju kuliku hinu. Veve yati ukuniwona chindu lepi, nambu vatumisi venavo veukuvajova yati vakunitopesa.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Hinu Mikali msikana wa Sauli apatili lepi mwana mbaka peafwili.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Ulota wa Natani kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Lus 17:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Nkosi Daudi peatamayi mu nyumba yaki ya chinkosi, Bambu Chapanga akamkita atama cha uteke kutali na makoko vaki voha. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Nkosi Daudi amjovili mlota Natani, “Lola, nene nitama mu nyumba yeyijengiwi kwa mikongo ya mielezi, kuni Lisanduku la Bambu Chapanga litama mu lindanda.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natani akamjovela nkosi, “Hamba ukakita chochoha chauholalela mu mtima waku, muni Bambu Chapanga avi pamonga na veve.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Nambu kilu yilayila Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Natani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Hamba ukamjovela mtumisi wangu Daudi, Bambu Chapanga ijova naa, ‘Wu, veve yati ukunijengela nene nyumba ya kutama? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Tangiya ligono lila penavawusili Vaisilaeli ku mulima wa Misili mbaka lelu nitami lepi mu nyumba. Nigendili kila pahali kuni nitama mu lindanda. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Pandu popoha penahambili na Vaisilaeli, niwayili lepi kumkota chilongosi yoyoha wa Izilaeli mwenamulagizi avayunga vandu va Izilaeli, ndava kyani anijengili lepi nyumba ya mielezi?’”<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Hinu Chapanga akayendelela kujova, “Mjovela mtumisi wangu Daudi, Bambu Chapanga mweavi na makakala goha ijova naa, ‘Nakuwusili kudasi kwewadima mambelele, muni uvatalalila vandu vangu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kuhumila lukumbi lwenulwo navi pamonga na veve kwokwoha kwewahamba, na navakomakisi vamakoko vaku voha palongolo yaku. Hinu yati nikulikita liina laku livya likulu ngati mahina ga vakulu vangi va pamulima. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Nene yati nikuvapela vandu vangu va Isilaeli pandu pa kutama na yati nikuvavika mwenumo muni vatama pandu pavi vene, vakotoka kung'ahiswa kangi. Vandu vahakau yati vakuvatesa lepi kavili ngati chavavakitili kadeni, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />tangiya penavahagwili vahamula ndava ya vandu vangu va Isilaeli. Nene yati nikuyangalila kuhumila kwa vamakoko vaku voha. Pagenago goha, nene Bambu Chapanga nikujovela kuvya yati nikujengela nyumba. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Ligono leufwayi na kuzikwa mu matinda ga vagogo vaku, nene yati nikumkita mwana mmonga pagati ya vana vaku veve wamwene avya nkosi, na nene yati nikuukangamalisa unkosi waki. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Mwene yati akunijengela nyumba ndava ya liina langu, na nene yati nikuukangamalisa unkosi waki magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nene yati nivya dadi waki na mwene yati ivya mwana wangu. Akakita gahakau yati nikumbuna ngati dadi cheakuvabuna vana vaki kwa ndonga. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Nambu uganu wangu wewangamalika yati nikuuwusa lepi kwaki ngati chenauwusili kwa Sauli, mwenamuwusili palongolo yaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Vandu va munyumba yaku na unkosi waku yati nikuukita uvya magono goha gangali mwishu. Chigoda chaku cha unkosi yati chivya chechikangamili magono goha gangali mwishu.’”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Natani amjovili Daudi mambu goha geajoviwi na Bambu Chapanga mu maono.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akumsengusa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Lus 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Kangi nkosi Daudi akayingila mugati mu Lindanda palongolo Bambu Chapanga, akatama pahi na kuyupa, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, nene ndi yani, na vandu vangu ndi kiki hati kunikwiha ngati naa chenivili nene hinu? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Lijambu lenili lavii lidebe pamihu paku, veve Bambu Chapanga, pamonga na genago uvaahidili vandu va munyumba yangu mambu gavaha mu miyaka yamahele yeyibwela, na unilangisi mambu ga viveleku vyevibwela, veve Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Nikujovela kyani neju, nene Daudi mtumisi waku? Muni veve Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wangu umanyili nene ndi namuhengaji waku! <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Ngati chewaahidili na kwa kugana kwaku wamwene, ukitili mambu goha gavaha muni unikita nene mtumisi waku nivya nigamanya. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Veve Bambu Chapanga mweuvili na makakala goha, veve ndi mkulu kuliku vandu voha. Kawaka mweavili ngati veve, veve ndu ndi Chapanga. Mambu goha getigayuwini kukuvala veve ndi gachakaka. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Kawaka vandu pamulima vevihotola kuwananiswa na vandu vaku va Isilaeli. Veve wahambili kuvagombola kuhuma ku Misli muni vavya vandu vaku. Veve Bambu Chapanga wajikitili liina na kukita mambu gavaha na gakukangasa. Ukavavinga vandu va milima hingi na michapanga yavi palongolo ya vandu vaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Uvakangamalisi vandu vaku va Isilaeli ndava yaku wamwene, muni vavya vandu vaku magono goha gangali mwishu, na veve uvi wa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wavi.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />Hinu, veve Bambu Chapanga, utimilisayi chila chawajovi ndava ya nene mtumisi waku na ndava ya vandu va munyumba yangu, uvakangamalisa magono goha gangali mwishu ngati chewaahidili. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Liina laku yati lilumbiwa magono goha gangali mwishu, na vandu yati vijova, ‘Bambu Chapanga mweavi na makakala goha ndi Chapanga panani ya Isilaeli.’ Vandu va munyumba yangu nene Daudi mtumisi waku, yati vikangamaliswa palongolo yaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Muni veve Bambu Chapanga mweuvi na makala goha, Chapanga wa Isilaeli, unigubukuli nene mtumisi waku, pewajovili, ‘Yati nikujengela nyumba.’ Chenicho ndi chechikunipela mtima wa kuyupa genaga palongolo yaku changali kutotokela.<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Hinu veve Bambu Chapanga, veve ndi Chapanga, lukumbi lwoha utimilisa ahadi zaku, na veve uniahidili nene mtumisi waku lijambu lenili labwina. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Hinu nikuyupa umotisayi chiveleku changu nene mtumisi waku chisindimala magono goha palongolo yaku, muni veve Bambu Chapanga waahidili chenicho, mewa mumota zaku vandu va munyumba yangu yati vimotiswa magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ihotola ngondo zamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Lus 18:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Pa genago, nkosi Daudi akavazangila kangi Vafilisiti na kuvahotola. Akautola muji wa Metigi Ama kuhuma kwa Vafilisiti.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Kangi Daudi avahotwili manjolinjoli va Vamoabu. Avavikili mu msitali vandu veavakamwili na kuvagoneka pahi. Akalagiza vala vevavilimu misitali hivili vakomiwayi na vala vevavili mu msitali wa datu vavaleka mumi. Hinu Vamoabu vakavya vatumisi vaki Daudi na vakavya vakumlipa kodi.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Mewa Daudi amuhotwili Hadadezeli mwana wa Lehobu, nkosi wa muji wa Soba weuvi mu mulima wa Vaalamu. Daudi ahotwili lukumbi Hadadezeli peavii munjila kuhamba kuwuyisa pandu pa mfuleni Efulati muni pavya mu utalalila waki. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi avakamwili vakwela falasi alufu yimonga na miya saba, na manjolinjoli vevagenda kwa magendelu alufu ishilini. Kangi Daudi akadumula misekete ya magendelu ga mumbele falasi vevahuta mutuka, nambu azilekili falasi miya yimonga zezahuta mutuka.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Vaalamu va ku Damasiko pevahamba kumtangatila Hadadezeli, nkosi wa Soba, Daudi avazangili na kuvakoma Vaalamu elufu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Kangi Daudi avikili kambi za ngondo ku muji wa Vaalamu va ku Damasiko. Hinu Vaalamu vakavya vatumisi vaki na vakavya vakumlipa kodi. Bambu Chapanga amkitli Daudi ahotola kwokwoha kweahambili. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi atolili vingwamba vya zahabu vyevagegili vakulu va manjolinjoli va Hadadezeli na kuzipeleka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Mewa atoli shaba zamahele neju kuhuma ku miji ya Beta na ku Belotai, miji yeyatalaliwi na Hadadezeli.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Toi nkosi wa ku Hamati, peayuwini kuvya Daudi auhotwili msambi wa manjolinjoli ga Hadadezeli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />amtumili Yolamu mwana waki ahamba kwa nkosi Daudi kumsengusa ndava ya kumuhotola Hadadezeli. Muni nkosi Hadadezeli na nkosi Toi vavi vamakoko na vene vatovini ngondo pamahele. Yolamu ampelekili Daudi njombi zamahele za vindu vya madini ga feza na vya zahabu na vya shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Daudi awusili njombi zenizo zivya ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, pamonga na madini ga feza na zahabu zeazitolili kuhuma ku milima yoha yeayihotwili, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />milima yeninyo ndi, Edomu na Moabu na Amoni na Filisitia na amaleki, pamonga na vindu vyeavitolili kwa nkosi Hadadezeli, mwana wa Lehobu nkosi wa Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Daudi amanyikini neju peawuyili kuhuma kuvakoma Vaedomu alufu kumi na nane ku Likemba la Mwinyu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Daudi avikili kambi ya manjolinjoli pamulima woha wa Edomu. Na Vaedomu voha va kwenuko vakavya vatumisi vaki. Bambu Chapanga amuhotwisi Daudi kuhotola kwokwoha kweahambili.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Hinu Daudi atalalili Isilaeli yoha, na mwene akavahamula vandu vaki voha ngati cheyaganikiwi changali kumpendelela mundu. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana wa Seluya, avi mkulu wa manjolinjoli. Yehoshafati mwana wa Ahiludi, avili muyandikaji wa mambu gegahumalili. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana wa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwana wa Abiatali, vene vavii vamteta. Selaya avii muyandikaji wa libanji la muhalu. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada avii chilongosi wa Vakeleti na Vapeleti vevavi valonda va Daudi, na vana va Daudi vakavya vevakuvatangatila vandu kulanda mihilu ya chinkosi.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Ubwina wa Daudi kwa Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Ligono limonga, Daudi akakota, “Wu, avi mundu yoyoha mweasigali mumi pagati ya vandu va munyumba ya Sauli? Ngati avili nigana kumuhengela gabwina ndava yalilaganu lenavikili na Yonatani.”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kwavili na mtumisi mmonga munyumba ya Sauli mweakemiwayi Siba. Vakamjovela ahamba kwa Daudi. Nkosi Daudi amkotili, “Veve ndi Siba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Mwene akayangula, “Ena ndi nene mtumisi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Nkosi akamkota, “Wu, kawaka mundu yoyoha mweasigalili mumi munyumba ya Sauli? Ngati avi nigana kumuhengela ubwina wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba akamyangula, “Avi mwana wa Yonatani, nambu mwene ana chilema cha magendelu.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Nkosi Daudi akamkota, “Avi kwoki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Siba akayangula, “Avi ku nyumba ya Makili mwana wa Amieli ku Lo Debali.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Hinu nkosi Daudi akavatuma vandu vakamleta, na mwene akaletwa kuhuma kunyumba ya Makili mwana wa Amieli ku Lo Debali.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Hinu, Mefibosheti mwana wa Yonatani, mjukulu wa Sauli akahamba kwa nkosi Daudi, akafugama palongolo ya nkosi Daudi. Daudi akamkemela, “Mefibosheti.” Na mwene akamyangula, “Ena, nene apa mtumisi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Nkosi Daudi akamjovela, “Kotoka kuyogopa. Nene yati nikuhengela gabwina ndava ya dadi waku Yonatani. Ndima yila yoha yeyavi ya gogo waku Sauli yati nikuwuyasila. Na veve magono goha yati wilya pamonga na nene munyumba yangu.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti akagundama, na kujova, “Nene ndi ngati libwa lelifwili, ndava kyani unihengela gabwina genago?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Kangi, nkosi Daudi akamkemela Siba mtumisi wa Sauli, akamjovela, “Vindu vyoha vyevyavili vya Sauli na vandu va munyumba yaki nimpelili Mefibosheti, mjukulu wa mkulu waku. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Veve na vana vaku na vatumisi vaku yati mukumlimila Mefibosheti na kumletela mabenu muni mjukulu wa mkulu waku avya na chakulya magono goha. Nambu mwene yati ilya pamonga na nene munyumba yangu.” Siba avi na vana vagosi kumi na muhanu na vatumisi ishilini.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Penapo Siba akamjovela nkosi, “Nene mtumisi waku yati nikita chindu chochoha cheukunijovela.” Hinu Mefibosheti alyayi chakulya chaki munyumba ya Daudi ngati mmonga wa vana va nkosi.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti avi na mwana mdebe mgosi mweakemewa Mika. Vandu va munyumba ya Siba vakavya vatumisi va Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Hinu, Mefibosheti mweavili na chilema cha magendelu gaki goha atamayi ku Yelusalemu na kulya chakulya chaki munyumba ya nkosi magono goha.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akuvahotola Vaamoli na Vaashulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Lus 19:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Pagenago nkosi Nahashi wa Vaamoni afwili, na mwana waki mweakemiwi Hanuni akavya nkosi pahala pa dadi waki. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Nkosi Daudi akajova, “Yati nikumkitila gabwina Hanuni, mwana wa Nahashi ngati Dadi waki chanihengili.” Hinu Daudi atumi vajumbi vakampolesa mtima Hanuni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Ndi vajumbi va Daudi pavahiki mulima wa Vaamoli, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />vakulu va Vaamoli vakamjovela mkulu wavi, Hanuni, “Uholalela kuvya Daudi cheavatumuli vandu vabwela kukupolesa mtima ndi amtopesa dadi waku? Wu, Daudi avatumi lepi vandu muni vakita umang'omesi mu muji muni vautolayi?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Hinu Hanuni akavakamula vajumbi vala vevatumwi na Daudi, akavaketa kila mmonga manjwemba gaki upandi umonga, akapapula nyula zavi pagati mbaka pamadaku, kangi akavaleka vahamba. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Daudi peajoviwi lijambu lenilo, akatuma vandu vakakonganeka navu, muni vajumbi venavo vavi na soni neju. Na mwene nkosi akavajovela, “Mtama pa muji wa Yeliko, mbaka manjwemba ginu pegimela, ndi muwuya ku nyumba.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Vaamoni pevaweni kuvya vamuyomisi Daudi, vakakodi manjolinjoli va likabila la Alamu elufu ishilini vavigenda kwa magendelu kuhuma ku Beti Lehobu na ku Soba, mewa nkosi Maaka atolili manjolinjoli elufu yimonga, mewa kuhuma ku Tobu atolili manjolinjoli elufu kumi na zivili. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Daudi peayuwini lijambu lenilo, akamlagiza Yoabu ahamba na manjolinjoli vaki voha. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Vaamoni vawukili na kujitendekeha kwa ngondo pa limlyangu la muji wa Laba, muji wavi ukulu, na Vaalamu kuhuma Soba na Lehobu na vandu kuhuma Tobu na Maaka vajipangi ku lukongolo.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu peaweni kuvya ngondo yivaha kulongolo na mumbele, akavahagula manjolinjoli vakekesi neju va Izilaeli, akavavika vatovana na Vaalamu vevavi ku lukongolo. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Akamuhagula Abishai mlongo waki avalongosa manjolinjoli vangi vala vevasigalili, na mwene Abishai akavapanga vatovana na Vaamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu akamjovela Abishai, “Ukawona Vaalamu vigana kunihotola ubwela kunitangatila, na nene nikawona Vaamoni vakuhotola yati nibwela kukutangatila. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Nambu mkangamala na titovana kwa makakala goha ndava ya vandu vitu na ndava ya miji ya Bambu Chapanga witu, na mwene Bambu Chapanga atikitilayi gala geakugawona gabwina kwaki.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Hinu Yoabu na vandu vaki vakahamba kulongolo kuvazangila Vaalamu, na vene Vaalamu vakatila. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Vaamoni pevaweni kuvya Vaalamu vatilili, ndi na vene mewa vamtilili Abishai na kuyingila mu muji. Hinu Yoabu akaleka kutovana na Vaamoni, akawuya ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Nambu Vaalamu pevaweni kuvya vavahotwili lepi Vaisilaeli, vakakonganesa pamonga manjolinjoli vavi. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Nkosi Hadadezeli alagizi Vaalamu vevavi kumwambu ya mfuleni Efulati valetwa, vavapeleka ku Helamu kuni vilongoswa na Shobaki mkulu wa manjolinjoli ga Hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi peayuwini makokoso genago, akonganisi manjolinjoli vaki pamonga, akayomboka mfuleni Yoludani akahamba mbaka ku Helamu, kula kwevajitendekili Vaalamu kutovana ngondo na Daudi, vakatumbula kutovana nayu. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Nambu Vaalamu vatilili palongolo ya Vaisilaeli. Daudi na vandu vaki vavakomili Vaalamu miya saba vevagendesa mutuka za ngondo na vakwela falasi elufu alubaini. Mewa vamlemisi Shobaki mkulu wa manjolinjoli vavi, akafwilila balapala. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Hinu vankosi voha vevavi vatumisi va Hadadezeli pevaweni vatoviwi na Vaisilaeli, vakayidakilana cha uteke na Vaisilaeli, na vakavya vatumisi va Vaisilaeli. Penapo Vaalamu vakayogopa na vavatangatili lepi kangi Vaamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi igonekana na Batisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Mukutumbula kwa mwaka wa mupya, lukumbi vankosi pevahambayi kutovana ngondo, Daudi amtumi Yoabu na vakulu va manjolinjoli vaki pamonga na manjolinjoli va Izilaeli. Vakavakomakesa Vaamoni na kuutindila muji wa Laba. Nambu Daudi asigalili ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Ligono limonga muhi, Daudi ayimwiki pa chitanda akahamba kunani ku golofa ya nyumba yaki ya chinkosi. Peagendayi ku golofa kwenuko, amuweni mdala mmonga isamba ku nyumba yaki, mdala mwenuyo anyambili neju. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Daudi amtumi mundu akakota mdala mwenuyo ndi yani. Mundu yula akamjovela “Mdala mwenuyo ndi Betisheba msikana wa Eliabu, na ndi mdala wa Ulia kuhuma mu likabila la Vahiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Ndi Daudi atumili vajumbi vamleta. Hinu Betisheba akabwela kwa Daudi, na mwene akagona nayu, mdala mwenuyo ahumi kujinyambisa ndava ya kuseka ngasi, kangi akawuya kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Badayi mdala mwenuyo akajimanya kuvya ana ndumbu, hinu akatuma ujumbi kwa Daudi kuvya avi na ndumbu yaki.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Hinu, Daudi akamtumila Yoabu ujumbi akajova, “Mtuma Ulia kuhuma mu likabila la Vahiti abwela kwa nene.” Na mwene Yoabu akamtuma Ulia ahamba kwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ulia peahiki kwaki, Daudi amkotili kumvala Yoabu na vandu voha mewa kuvala ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Kangi Daudi akamjovela Ulia, “Wuya kunyumba yaku ukapumulila chidogo.” Ulia akawuka muyumba ya nkosi, lukumbi lulalula nkosi akampelekela njombi. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Nambu Ulia awuyili lepi kunyumba yaki, nambu agonili pa limlyangu la nyumba ya chinkosi pamonga na valonda va nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Daudi peajoviwi kuvya Ulia ahambili lepi ku nyumba yaki, Daudi amkotili Ulia, “Veve uwuyili ndu kuhuma ku ngondo, wavili lepi pa nyumba mu magono gamahele, ndava kyani uhambi lepi kunyumba yaku?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ulia akamyangula Daudi, “Lisanduku la Lilaganu, pamonga na manjolinjoli voha va Isilaeli na Yuda vitama mu mandanda ku ngondo. Mkulu wangu Yoabu na vatumisi vaki voha vagoni ku lukongolo. Wu, chabwina nene kuhamba kunyumba nikalyai na kunywa na kugona na mdala wangu? Nene nilapa palongolo yaku, nihotola lepi kukita chindu ngati chenicho.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Kangi Daudi akamjovela Ulia, “Hinu tama penapa lelu, chilau yati nikuleka uhamba.” Hinu ligono lenilo Ulia asigalili pamuji wa Yelusalemu, na ligono lelalandili, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi amgongolili Ulia munyumba yaki kulya na kunywa, akamkita Ulia agala. Hati naha, kilu yila Ulia ahambi lepi kunyumba yaki, nambu agoni pampasa waki pamonga na valonda va nkosi waki.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Lukela lwaki, Daudi ayandiki balua akampela Ulia ayipeleka kwa Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mubalua yeniyo daudi ayandiki naha, “Mvika Ulia palongolo pandu peyikolaniki neju ngondo, nyenye muhegelela mumbele asigalila mwene muni atoviwa mbaka kufwa.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Hinu Yoabu peauzangila muji, amviki Ulia pandu peamanyili kuvya pavi na manjolinjoli vakekesi va vamakoko. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Vakolonjinji va muji wenuwo vahumili mu muji wavi kubwela kutovana na manjolinjoli vevalongwiswi na Yoabu. Vatumisi vangi va Daudi vakomiwi, na Ulia wa kuhuma mu likabila la Vahiti mewa akomiwi.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Kangi Yoabu apeliki ujumbi kwa Daudi kumjovela mambu goha gegahumalili ku ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoabu amlagizi mtumisi mweamtumili, “Peumalayi kumjovela nkosi mambu goha kuvala ngondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />nkosi ihotola kuyoma, na ihotola kukukota, ‘Ndava kyani pemwatovanayi mwahegalili papipi na muji? Mwamanyi lepi kuvya ngavahotwili kuvatova na nduta kuhuma mu luwumba lwa muji wavi? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Yani amkomili Abimeleki mwana wa Yelubasheti? Wu, mdala lepi mmonga pa muji wa Tebesi mweamgwisili liganga la kuyagila kuhuma mu luwumba ndi likamukoma Abimeleki? Ndava kyani hinu, mwaluhegalili luwumba?’ Akakukotayi chenichi veve mjovela naha, ‘Hati mtumisi waku Ulia wa likabila la Vahiti na mwene mewa afwili.’”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Mjumbi yula akahamba kwa Daudi na kumjovela goha gealagizwi na Yoabu agajova. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Mjumbi yula akamjovela Daudi, “Makoko vitu vatizidili makakala, vakahuma kuvala ya muji na kutizangila ku lukongolo. Hati naha tete tavavingasini mbaka ku limlyangu la muji wavi. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Kangi vevajugumila nduta vatijugumili tete vatumisi vaku kuhuma mu luwumba. Vatumisi vaku vangi vakomiwi. Hati mtumisi waku Ulia kuhuma mu likabila la Vahiti mewa afwili.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi akamjovela mjumbi yula, “Mjovela naha Yoabu, ‘Lijambu lenili likotoka kukung'aha muni upanga uvi lepi na mihu, ngondo yikoma mundu yoyoha yula. Mkangamala na muvatova vandu va muji wenuwo na muutola muji wenuwo.’ Ukamjovela Yoabu chenicho muni umkangamalisa mtima.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Batisheba mdala wa Ulia peayuwini kuvya mngana waki afwii, amvembenikili mgana waki. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Magono ga malilu pegamaliki, Daudi amtolili Batisheba akamleta pa mu nyumba yaki, akavya mdala waki, na mwene Batisheba akamvelekela Daudi mwana mgosi. Nambu lijambu lenilo leakitili Daudi lamganisi lepi Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Natani akumlakalila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga akamtuma mlota Natani kwa Daudi. Natani akamuhambila Daudi na kumjovela, “Kwavili na vagosi vavili ku muji umonga, mmonga avili na vindu vyamahele na yungi avi mngangu. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Mwana vindu vyamahele yula avi na mambelele gamahele na ng'ombi zamahele neju. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Nambu mngangu yula avi na limbelele limonga lidala lidebe lealigulili. Akaliyunga na likakula munyumba yaki pamonga na vana vaki. Chakulya chilachila cheilya mwene ndi chealipelili limbelele laki, na chikombi cheanywelelayi mwene ndi chichocho chelanywelela limbelele laki. Mewawa limbelele lenilo lagonayi mu mawoko gaki. Limbelele lenilo lavi ngati msikana waki mngangu mwenuyo. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Ligono limonga mwana vindu vyamahele yula ahikiwi na myehe. Ndi mwanavindu vyamahele aganili lepi kutola limbelele laki limonga amala ng'ombi yaki amuhinjila myehe waki, nambu akahamba kumnyaga mngangu yula limbelele waki na kumuhijila myehe waki.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daudi peayuwini genago, akayoma ndava ya mundu mwanavindu vyamahele. Akamjovela mlota Natani, “Nilapa kwa Bambu Chapanga mweavi mumi kuvya mundu mwakiti lijambu lenilo iganikiwa akomiwayi! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Yiganikiwa amlipa mngangu yula mambelele mcheche ndava ya limbelele lila leamunyagili, ndava muni akiti lijambu lihakau na avi lepi na lipyana!”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Natani akamjovele Daudi, “Mundu mwene ndi veve! Hinu Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli, ijova naha, ‘Nene nakunyalili mahuta uvya nkosi wa Isilaeli na nikakusangula mmawoko ga Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nakupelili unkosi wa Sauli na vasikana vaki vavya vadala vaku, nikakukita uvya nkosi wa Isilaeli na Yuda. Ngati genago gavili gadebe kwaku, nganikuyongasili neju ya genago. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ndava kyani, uvevisi lilovi langu nene Bambu Chapanga na kukita uhakau uwu palongolo yangu? Umkomili Ulia mundu wa likabila la Vahiti ku ngondo kwa upanga, umtoli mdala waki avya mdala waku. Uvakiti Vaamoni vamkoma Ulia ku ngondo! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Hinu, ndava muni univevisi umtoli mdala wa Ulia mund wa likabila la Vahiti avya mdala waku, kufwa kwa kukomana yati kuwuka lepi mu uveleku waku.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Chenichi ndi cheijova Bambu Chapanga, ‘Lola, yati nileta mang'aiso kwa vandu va munyumba yaku wamwene. Yati nikuvatola vadala vaku kuni wilola na kumpela mgosi wa papipi yaku, na mwene yati igona navu pawaka. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Veve wakitili lijambu lenilo chimfiyu, nambu nene yati nikita muhi kuni Vaisilaeli voha vilola.’”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Hinu, Daudi akamjovela Natani, “Nimbudili Bambu Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natani akamjovela, “Bambu Chapanga akulekekisi kubuda kwaku na veve yati ufwa lepi. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Nambu ndava ya chenichi cheukitili chivakita vamakoko va Bambu Chapanga vamvevesayi neju, mwana waku mwaivelekwayi yati ifwa.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Kangi nasani akawuya kunyumba yaki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Mwana wa Daudi mweamveliki na Batisheba ifwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Bambu Chapanga amtovi mwana wa Daudi mweaveliki na Batisheba mweavi mdala wa Ulia, na mwene akavya mtamu.<verse eid="2SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi amyupi Chapanga muni mwana alama. Akajihinisa chakulya na akahamba ku chumba chaki akagona pahi changatandika chindu kilu yoha. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Vatumisi vakulu va munyumba yaki vakamyupa ayimuka, nambu mwene abelili, na alili lepi chakulya chochoha pamonga nawu. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Pelapiti lijuma limonga mwana yula akafwa. Vatumisi wayogwipi kumjovela Daudi kuvya mwana afwili, muni vaholalili, “Mwana mwenuyo peavii mumi, talongi nayu, nambu atiyuwanili lepi. Hinu yati tikumjovela wuli kuvya mwana waki afwili? Pangi yati akujilemasa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi pealoli vatumisi vaki vinong'onelana, akamanya kuvya mwana afwili. Ndi akavakota, “Wu, mwana afwili?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Vene vakamyangula, “Ena! Afwii.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Kangi, Daudi akayima kuhuma pahi, akasamba, na kunyala mahuta na kuwala nyula zingi. Kangi akahamba kunyumba ya Bambu Chapanga na akamfugamila. Kangi akawuya ku nyumba yaki akayupa chakulya, vakampela akalya. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Vatumisi vaki vakamkota, “Lijambu ng'ani lenili leukitili? Mwana peavi mumi, veve wajihinisi na kumvembela. Nambu afwili uyimwiki na kulya chakmlya.”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi akavayangula, “Chakaka mwana peavi mumi, najihinisi na kuvemba. Nakitili chenicho muni naholali kuvya, ‘Yani imanya? Pangi Bambu Chapanga nganihengili lipyana na kumleka mwana avya mumi.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Nambu hinu afwili, ndava kyani nijihinisayi? Wu, nene nihotola kumuwuyisa pa mulima? Ligono limonga yati nihamba kwenuko kweahambili, nambu mwene ihotola lepi kuwuya kuni kwanivii nene.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Kangi Daudi akampolesa mtima Batisheba mdala waki. Akagona nayu, ndi akavya na ndumbu na kuveleka mwana mgosi, Daudi amkemili mwana mwenuyo Solomoni. Bambu Chapanga amganili mwana mwenuyo. <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Bambu Chapanga amtumili mlota Natani kwa Daudi kuvya amkemela mwana mwenuyo Yedidia mana yaki mweaganiwi na Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akuutola chi makakala muji wa Laba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Lus 20:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Yoabu atovini na vandu va muji wa Vaamoni, weukemewa Laba, ndi akautola muji wenuwo wa chinkosi <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu akatuma ujumbi kwa Daudi, akajova, “Nivatovili vandu va muji wa Laba, na nitolili chinyepa chavi cha manji. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Hinu vatola manjolinjoli voha vevasigalili, muutindila muji na kuutola chimakakala. Nambu ngati nikautola nene, yati ukemiwa kwa liina langu” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Hinu, Daudi akatola manjolinjoli vaki voha akahamba ku Laba, akauzangila na kuutola muji wenuwo. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Kangi Daudi akatola litaji la chinkosi la zahabu kuhuma pa mutu wa chimong'omong'o cha mchapanga Moleki wa Vaamoni. Utopa wa litaji lenilo wavii kilo selasini na muhanu, mugati yaki mwavili na liganga la mashonga gamahele. Hinu Daudi atolili liganga lenilo la mashonga gamahele, akalivika mu litaji laki la chinkosi. Mewa atolili vindu vyamahele neju kuhuma mu muji wenuwo. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Kangi avatolili vandu va muji wenuwo, akavavika vahenga lihengu kwa kutumila misumeno na sululu na mavagu na kuvatumila kuhenga lihengu palitanulu la matofali, chenicho ndi cheayikitili miji yoha ya Vaamoni. Pagenago Daudi na manjolinjoli vaki voha vakawuya ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnoni akumlimba Tamali dada yaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Pagenago, Abusalomu mwana mgosi wa Daudi avi na mlumbu mweanyambili neju mweakemewa Tamali. Amnoni mwana yungi wa Daudi, amganili neju Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnoni ang'ahiki neju ndava ya kumgana Tamali mbaka akavya mtamu, ndava ya Tamali mlumbu waki. Tamali avii mdala mweangammanya mgosi, na yaloliki Amnoni ihotola lepi kukita nayu chindu chochoha. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Nambu Amnoni avi na mkozi mweakemiwa Yonadabu, mwana wa Shama, mlongo wa Daudi. Yonadabu avi mundu mweavi na umanya. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu akamkota Amnoni, “Veve wa mwana wa nkosi, ndava kyani uganda magono goha? Ndava kyani ugani lepi kunijovela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnoni akamjovela, “Nikumgana neju Tamali, mlumbu wa mlongo wangu Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu akamjovela Amnoni, “Veve jigoneka pa chitanda ujikitayi ulwala neju. Dadi waku peibwea kukulola, veve mjovela, ‘Nikuyupa umleka Tamali abwela anitelekela chakulya na aniliha kwa chiwoko chaki kuni nikumlola.’” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Hinu, Amnoni akayendelela kugona na kujikita ilwala. Nkosi peahambili kumlola, Amnoni akamjovela, “Nikuyupa, umleka Tamali abwela apa anitelekela mabumunda gadebe na aniliha kwa chiwoko chaki kuni nikumlola.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Hinu, Daudi apeliki ujumbi kwa Tamali mweavii munyumba ya chinkosi, “Hamba ku nyumba ya Amnoni muhaja waku, ukamtelekela chakulya.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Tamali akahamba kwenuko, akamkolela Amnoni agonili. Akatola uhembe, akauhinyanga, akateleka mabumunda palongolo ya Amnoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Mabumunda genago pegapili, Tamali akayokola mu chikalangu. Akampelekela Amnoni, nambu Amnoni akabela kulya, akajova, “Kila mmonga mweavi penapa ahuma kuvala” Vandu voha vakahuma kuvala. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Kangi Amnoni akamjovela Tamali, “Hinu niletela mabumunda genago ku chumba changu, na uniliha.” Tamali akatola mabumunda geagateliki na kupeleka ku chumba cha Amnoni muhaja waki. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Bahopo peamliha mabumunda genago, Amnoni akamakamula Tamali na kumjovela, “Bwela ugona na nene!”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamali akamjovela “Lepi muhaja wangu, kotoka kuning'ang'anisa. Lijambu ngati lenili liganikiwa lepi kukitika pa Isilaeli. Kotoka kukita chitendu chenichi cha uhakahu. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Nene nihotola lepi kusindimala soni ngati iyi. Na veve yati uvya mmonga wa vahakahu na vahimu pa mulima wa Isilaeli. Hinu nikuyupa kalongela na nkosi muni mwene yati akubesa lepi kunigega.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Nambu Amnoni agani lepi kumyuwanila na ndava muni avi na makakala neju kuliku mwene, akamng'ang'anisa mbaka akahotola kugonekana nayu.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Kangi Amnoni amvengi neju Tamali. Amvengili Tamali kuliku cheamganili pakutumbula. Akamjovela Tamali, “Wuka uhamba.”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamali Akamyangula, “Lepi muhaja wangu, uhakau wenuwo wa kunivinga nene yati wivya uvaha neju kuliku chila cheunikitili.” Nambu Amnoni aganili lepi kumuyuwanila.<verse eid="2SA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Amnoni akamkemela mtumisi waki mweakumuhengela, akamjovela, “Muwusa mdala uyu palongolo yangu. Na mlyangu udinda kwa kabali.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Hinu mtumisi yula akamuwusa Tamali kuvala na kudinda mlyangu kwa kabali. Tamali awalili ligawuni litali lelilembiwi bwina, chenicho ndi chevawalayi vasikana va nkosi vevangammanya mgosi lukumbi lwenulo.<verse eid="2SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Hinu Tamali akanyala lyenge kumutu, akapapula ligauni laki lelilembiwi lealiwalili, akavika mawoko gaki kumutu, akawuka kuni ivemba kwa lwami. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Abusalomu muhaja waki peamuwene mlumbu waki, akamkota, “Wu, Amnoni muhaja waku agoni na veve? Guna mulumbu wangu, mwene ndi muhaja waku, lijambu lenili likoto kukuvina mu mtima.” Hinu Tamali akatama mu nyumba ya Abusalomu kuni iviniswa neju mu mtima.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Nkosi Daudi peayuwini lijambu lenilo ayomili neju. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abusalomu amvengi neju Amnoni na aganili lepi hati kulongela nayu, ndava muni amkolisi soni Tamali kwa kugona nayu chimakakala.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusalomu akumkoma Amnoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Peyapitili miyaka hivili, vandu va kudumula mangoma ga mambelele ga Abusalomu pevavili ku muji wa Baali Hasoli, papipi na mibaka ya muji wa Efulaimu. Abusalomu akavagongolela vana voha vagosi va nkosi vahamba kwenuko. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abusalomu akamuhambila nkosi Daudi akamjovela, “Nkosi wangu, nene mtumisi waku yati nivya nidumula mangoma ga mambelele. Wu, veve nkosi pamonga na vatumisi vaku, muhotola kuhamba pamonga na nene?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Nkosi akamyangula, “Lepi wa mwana wangu tikotoka kuhamba tavoha tikavya mzigu kwaku.” Pamonga kuvya Abusalomu amyupili dadi waki ahamba, nkosi akabela kuhamba, akammotisa na kumjovela ahamba katama bwina.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Kangi Abusalomu akamjovela, “Ngati yati uhamba lepi mleka mlongo wangu Amnoni tihamba naku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Nkosi akamyangula, “Ndava kyani ahamba pamonga na veve?”<verse eid="2SA 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Nambu Abusalomu ayendalili kumyupa, na pamwishu nkosi akamleka Amnoni pamonga na vana vaki voha vagosi vahamba.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abusalomu akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Mumyangalila Amnoni peinywa divayi na kugala, nikavajovela, ‘Mumtova Amnoni,’ nyenye mumtova na kumkoma. Mkoto kuyogopa, nene ndi mwanivapeli malagizu genaga. Hinu mkangamala na muvya umanya.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Hinu, vatumisi vala vakitili Amnoni ngati chevalagizwi na Abusalomu, ndi vana vangi vagosi va nkosi vakawuka kila mmonga akakwela punda falasi na kutila.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Pevavi munjila, Daudi ajoviwi kuvya vana vaki voha vakomiwi na Abusalomu, kawaka hati mmonga mweasigali mumi. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Nkosi Daudi akayima akapapula nyula zaki kwa ungolongondi akagona pahi. Hati vatumisi vaki voha vevayimili papipi nayu mewa vakapapula nyula zavi. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Penapo akabwela Yonadabu mwana wa Shimea, mlongo waki Daudi, akamjovela, “Mkulu wangu, kotoka kuholale kuvya vana vaku voha vakomiwi. Amnoni mwene ndi mweakomiwi. Lijambu lenili Abusalomu apangili kukita tangiya Amnoni peagoni chi makakala na Tamali mlumbu waki. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Hinu mkulu wangu, kotoka kuholalela mu mtima waku kuvya vana vaku voha vafwili. Amnoni mwene ndu ndi mweakowi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Nambu Abusalomu amali kutila. Na msongolo mweavili mlonda wa nyumba ya nkosi, akawona msambi uvaha wa vandu vibwela kuhuma ku chitumbi mu njila yeyihuma ku Holonaimu.<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu akamjovela Daudi, “Lola nkosi, vana vaku vibwela ngati chenakujovili nene mtumisi waku.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Mtumisi yula peamali ndu kujova genago, vana vagosi va nkosi vakayingila, vakatumbula kuvemba kwa lwami. Nkosi na vatumisi vaki voha vavembili kwa mvinisu.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Nambu Abusalomu atilalili kwa Talimai mwana wa Amihudi, nkosi wa muji wa Geshuli. Nkosi Daudi akamvembenekela mwana waki Amnoni kwa magono gamahele. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abusalomu peatilalili ku muji wa Geshuli, akatama kwenuko kwa lukumbi lwa miyaka yidatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Mvinisu wa nkosi Daudi ndava ya lifwa la Amnoni pewamaliki, akatumbula kunogela kumlola mwana waki Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu ikita mpangu wa kumuwuyisa Abusalomu ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana wa Seluya, amanyili kuya nkosi Daudi inogela neju kumuwona Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Hinu Yoabu amtumili mundu ahamba ku Tekoa muni amlondela mdala mweavi na luhala. Peamletili, akamjovela, “Yigisayi kuvya uvi mukuvembeneka. Walayi nyula za kuvembeneka, koto kunyala mahuta nambu ujikita ngati mdala mweakumvembenekela mundu waki mweafwili mu magono gamahele. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Kangi uhamba kwa nkosi ukamjovela genaga genikujovela.” Hinu Yoabu akamjovela malovi ga kumjovela nkosi.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Hinu mdala mwenuyo wa kuhuma ku Tekoa akahamba kwa nkosi, akafugama na kugundama mbaka pahi cha utopesa palongolo ya nkosi, akamjovela, “Veve nkosi nitangatila.”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Nkosi akamkota, “Chikung'aa kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Mdala yula akayangula, “Nene ndi nalipwela, mgosi wangu afwili. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Navi na vana vagosi vavili. Ligono limonga, pevavi ku lukongolo, vakatumbula kutovana. Ndava muni pavi lepi na mundu wa kuvalekenganisa, mwana wangu mmonga akamtova myaki akamkoma. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Hinu vandu voha va lukolo lwangu vaning'anamuki nene mtumisi waku, vigana nimuwusa kwavi mwana mweamkomili myaki muni vamkoma, ndava amkomi myaki. Hinu vakamkoma mwenuyu nivya lepi na muhali. Vakakita chenicho, yati viwusa neju huvalila yangu yeyisigali, na mngana wangu yati vakumlekela lepi lihina amala chiveleku pa mulima.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Nkosi akamyangula mdala yula, “Wuya kunyumba yaku, yati nikutangatila kumala lijambu laku.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Mdala yula kuhuma ku Tekoa akajova, “Mkulu wangu nkosi, malungamiku goha gavya ndava yangu na ndava ya valongo va dadi wangu. Hinu, veve nkosi na unkosi waku mkotoka kuvya mwemubudili.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Nkosi akamjovela “Mundu yoyoha mweakuyogopesa mleta kwa nene, na mwene yati iwuyila lepi kavili kukung'aha.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Mdala yula akamjovela, “Chondi nkosi, niyupila kwa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, muni mlongo wangu yula mweagana kulipisa ndava ya lifwa la mwana wangu, akotoka kukita lijambu lingi livaha la kumkoma mwana wangu yungi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Nkosi Daudi akamjovela, “Nilapa kwa lihina la Bambu Chapanga mweavi mumi, yati kuvya lepi na mundu hati mmonga mweakumlemasayi mwana waku.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Mdala yula akamjovea, “Nikuyupa, nene mtumisi waku, leka nijova lilovi limonga kwaku nkosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Nkosi akamjovela, “Jova.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Mdala yula akamjovela, “Ndava kyani hinu ugana kukita uhakau uwu kwa vandu va Chapanga? Kuwanangana na cheujovili kuvala lijambu lenilo, ujihamwili wamwene ndava ugana lepi kumleka mwana waku awuyayi kuhuma kula kweatilalili. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Tete tavoha yati tifwa. Tete ndi ngati manji gegiyitika na gegiyoleka lepi. Bambu Chapanga ikoma lepi, nambu ikita njila muni yula mweavingiwi awuya kuhuma ku mahamilu. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Nene nibwelili kulongela na veve mkulu wangu ndava vandu vaniyogopisi. Hinu nene mtumisi waku naholalili kuvya, ‘Mbanga nikalongeli na nkosi, pangi nkosi yati ikita lijambu lenili lenimjovela nene mtumisi waki. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Muni nkosi yati akuniyuwanila na kunisangula kuhuma kwa mundu mweigana kunikomakesa nene na mwana wangu kuhuma mu uhali weatipeli Chapanga.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Nene mhengaji waku naholalili kuvya, ‘Lilovi laki mkulu wangu nkosi yati likunipela uteke mu mtima wangu, muni mwene mkulu wangu nkosi avi ngati mtumu wa Chapanga mweukugamanya gabwina na gahakau.’ Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, avya pamonga na veve.”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ndi nkosi akamyangula mdala yula, “Kotoka kunihiha lijambu loloha lenikukota.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Mdala yula akajova, “Jova nkosi wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Nkosi akamkota, “Wu, uwungini lepi na Yoabu mulijambu lenili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Mdala yula akajova, “Nilapa kwa veve mkulu wangu nkosi mweuvi mumi, mundu ihotola lepi kuyepa upandi kulyela amala kumangeya kuvala lijambu leujovili nkosi wangu. Yoabu mtumisi waku ndi mweanitumi. Mwene ndi mweanijovi malovi goha genikujovili nene mtumisi waku. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu mtumisi waku akitili chenicho ndava uliholalelayi kavili lijambu lenili. Nambu veve mkulu wangu uvii na luhala na umanyili kila chindu chechihengeka pamulima ngati vamtumu va Chapanga va kuanani.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Kangi nkosi akamjovela Yoabu, “Chabwina, yati nikita chaugana, hambayi ukamuwuyisa kunyumba msongolo Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu afugimi na kugundama mbaka pahi cha utopesa, akammotisa nkosi, akajova, “Lelu nene mtumisi waku, mkulu wangu nkosi. Nimanyili kuvya niyidakiliwi palongolo yaku, ndava veve bambu wangu nkosi uyidakili kuyupa kwangu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Hinu Yoabu akawuka, akahamba ku Geshuli akamuwuyisa Abusalomu pa muji wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Nambu nkosi akajova, “Abusalomu atama kutali na nene, atama kunyumba yaki. Akotoka kubwela kunilola.” Hinu Abusalomu akatama kunyumba yaki, na mwene akonganeka lepi na nkosi Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusalomu iyelewana na nkosi Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Pamulima woha wa Izilaeli, kwavili lepi na mundu mwealumbiwa kuvya anyambili neju ngati Abusalomu. Kuhumila ku luwayu mbaka ku mutu kwaki, Abusalomu avi lepi na kasolo yoyoha. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Abusalomu aketayi manjwili gaki kila lukumbi peawini gitopela ku mutu waki. Kila peaketili na kupima, zavi na utopa ngati wa kilo zivili kulandana na chipimu cha chinkosi. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abusalomu avii na vana vagosi vadatu na mwana mdala mmonga lihina laki Tamali. Tamali avi msikana wabwina.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Hinu Abusalomu atamili ku muji wa Yelusalemu kwa miyaka hivili changali kukonganeka na nkosi Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Kangi Abusalomu atumili ujumbi kwa Yoabu, kumuyupa ahamba kwa nkosi pahala paki, nambu Yoabu akabela kubwela. Abusalomu akatuma ujumbi mala ya pili nambu Yoabu abelili kubwela. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Hinu Abusalomu akavajovela vatumisi vaki, “Lola, Yoabu ana mgunda wa shayili papipi na mgunda wangu. Muhamba mukauyocha motu.” Ndi vatumisi va Abusalomu vakahamba kuuyocha motu mgunda wa Yoabu.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu akahamba kunyumba ya Abusalomu akamkota, “Ndava kyani vatumisi vaku vauyochi motu mgunda wangu?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abusalomu akamyangula, “Lola nakuletili ujumbi, ubwela kuni muni nikutuma kwa nkosi ukamukotayi, ‘Ndava kyani aniwuyisi kuhuma ku Geshuli? Mbanga nganisigalili kwenuko.’ Hinu nitangatila nihotola kukonganeka na nkosi. Ngati nihokili, anikomayi!”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Hinu Yoabu akahamba kumjovela nkosi malovi genago goha. Nkosi akamkemela Abusalomu, na mwene akayingila kwa nkosi, akafugama na kugundama mbaka pahi cha utopesa palongolo ya nkosi, na nkosi akamkumbatila Abusalomu cha uganu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abusalomu igana kunyaga unkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Pegapitili magono gamahele, Abusalomu atolili mutuka za kuhutwa na falasi na vandu hamusini va kulongolela palongolo yaki. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abusalomu ayovalili kuyimuka lukela na kuhamba kuyima pamuhana ya njila yeyihamba ku limlyangu la muji. Mundu yoyoha mweavi na muhalu na kugana kumpelekela nkosi ndava ya kuhamuliwa, Abusalomu amkemili mundu mwenuyo pamuhana na kumkota, “Uhuma muji woki?” Ngati mundu mwenuyo ngaajova ihuma muji nunuyu wa likabila la Isilaeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abusalomu ngaamjovili, “Muhalu waku ndi wachakaka neju. Nambu kawaka mundu yoyoha mweiyima pahala pa nkosi kukuyuwanila.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Kangi Abusalomu ngaayendalili kujova, “Ngati nene nganivya muamula wa Vaisilaeli! Nene nganimukitili uhamula weukumpela haki yaki.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Mewa mundu yoyoha mweamuhambili na kugundama cha utopesa palongolo yaki, Abusalomu ngaamukamwili kwa mawoko gaki na kumkumbatila. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Chenicho ndi cheakitili Abusalomu kwa Vaisilaeli voha vevabwelili kwa nkosi ndava ya kugana uhamula. Ndava ya kukita chenicho, Abusalomu akavakita Vaisilaeli vamahele vamganayi mu mitima yavi.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Peyapitili miyaka mcheche, Abusalomu amjovili nkosi, “Chondi leka nihamba ku Hebuoni kutimilisa chilapu changu chenamvikili Bambu Chapanga, <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />muni nene mtumisi waku penatamili ku Geshuli ya ku mulima wa Alamu, namvikili Bambu Chapanga chilapu, najovili, ‘Ngati Bambu Chapanga yati akaniwuyisayi ku Yelusalemu, yati nikumfugamila mwene ku Hebuloni.’”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Nkosi akamjovela, “Hamba cha uteke” Abusalomu akawuka na kuhamba ku Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Nambu Abusalomu atumili vajumbi chimfiyu mu makabila goha ga Isilaeli, akavajovela, “Pemuyuwana lwami lwa lipenenga, mjova, ‘Abusalomu akitiwi kuvya nkosi wa ku Hebuloni!’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abusalomu peahambili ku Hebuloni, alongosini na vandu miya zivili veavagongolili kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, na vene vahambili kwa ubwina, vamanyili lepi chindu chochoha cheagana kukita Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Abusalomu peawusa luteta lwa kutinyisa, atumili ujumbi kwa Ahitofeli wa ku muji wa Gilo mweamtangatilayi nkosi Daudi kuhamula mambu. Penapo uhakau wa Abusalomu wayonjosiki kupata makakala na vandu vealandini nawu vayonjosiki neju.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkosi Daudi itila ku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Mjumbi akabwela na kumjovela nkosi Daudi, “Mitima ya vandu va Isilaeli hiwungini na Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Hinu, Daudi akavajovela watumisi vaki vevavili pamonga na mwene ku Yelusalemu, “Mubwela titilayi kanyata, ngati chatikiti lepi chenicho, kawaka mundu mwailama, Abusalomu yati ibwela peapa na kumkoma kila mundu pa muji!”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Nambu vatumisi vaki voha vakamjovela, “Tete tavatumisi vaku, bambu witu nkosi, tivili bwina kukita lijambu loloha leugana.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Hinu nkosi akawuka pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki na vatumisi vaki voha, nambu akavaleka vadala vaki va kuvala kumi vaiyangalila nyumba ya chinkosi.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Nkosi akawuka pamonga na vandu vaki voha. Nambu pevahikili patali chidogo, pa nyumba ya mwishu wa muji, vakayima. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Vatumisi voha va nkosi, pamonga na Vakeleti na Vapeleti vevavili valonda vaki, pamonga na Vagiti miya sita vevamlandi nkosi Daudi kuhuma ku muji wa Gati, vapitili palongolo ya nkosi Daudi, <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />nkosi Daudi peamuwene Itai, kuhuma ku Giti akamkota, “Ndava kyani hati veve ulongosini pamonga na tete? Wuya ukatama pamonga na nkosi Abusalomu. Muni veve kuni wamuyehe mewa ndi mjumbaji kuhuma ku mulima winu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Veve wabwelile kuni jana ndu. Wu, lelu nikukitayi uvya wamundu wa kulyungalyunga na tete kuni namwene nimanyili lepi kwenihamba? Wuya kunyumba pamonga na valongo vaku. Mwene Bambu Chapanga yati akukukitila uganu waki na ubwina waki.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Nambu Itai akamyangula nkosi, “Nilapa kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga mweavii mumi na kwa veve nkosi wangu, popoha peuhamba, yikavya kwa lifwa amala kwa kuvya mumi, nene mtumisi waku yati nihamba na veve.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Hinu Daudi akamjovela Itai, “Chabwina! hamba kulongolo.” Hinu Itai, mweahumalili ku Giti, akapita mwene na vandu vaki voha pamonga na vana vaki. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Daudi peapitayi pamonga na vandu vaki, vandu vangi voha vevasigalili pa Yelusalemu vakavemba kwa lwami luvaha. Nkosi Daudi akayomboka likemba la Kidiloni pamonga na vandu voha, vakahamba kulukongolo.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Sadoki na mwene avili penapo, na Valawi voha vevagegili Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga, vakalihulusa pahi na mwene Abitali akawusa teta ya kutinyiswa mbaka vandu voha pevamali kuwuka pa muji wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Kangi nkosi Daudi akamjovela Sadoki, “Tola Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga uliwuyisayi ku muji wa Yelusalemu. Ngati Bambu Chapanga yati akuniyidakila, yati akuniwuyisa, na nene nikuliwona kangi Lisanduku lenili la Bambu Chapanga na kupawona pandu penapa peitama. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Nambu ngati Bambu Chapanga yati iganiswa lepi na nene, anikitila chochoha cheiwona kuvya chabwina kwaki.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Nkosi Daudi amjovili kavili mteta Sadoki, “Mtola mwana waku Ahimaasi pamonga na Yonatani mwana wa Abiatali muwuya ku muji cha uteke. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Nene yati nilindila ku mitandu uko ku lukongolo mbaka penipokela makokoso kuhuma kwinu.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Hinu Sadoki na Abiatali vakawuyisa Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga ku Yelusalemu na vene vakatama kwenuko.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Nambu Nkosi Daudi akayendelela na lugendu, akakwela chitumbi cha Mizeituni kuni ivemba. Awalili lepi hilatu, na agubiki mutu waki na nyula kulangisa kuviniswa. Na vandu voha vevavili pamonga na mwene vakagubika mitu yavi, vakakwela chitumbi kuni vivemba. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Lukumbi lwenulo Daudi ajoviwi kuvya Ahitofeli avili pamonga na vamakoko vevajiwungili na Abusalomu. Ndi nkosi Daudi akayupa akajova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga nikuyupa, ng'anamusa makokoso ga Ahitofeli gavya uhimu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Nkosi Daudi peahikili panani ya chitumbi, pandu pa kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga, mundu mmonga liina laki Hushai kuhuma ku Aliki, abwelili kumpokela, kuni apapwili nyula zaki na kujiyitila lububu ku mutu waki kulangisa kuvya avii na mvinisu. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Nkosi Daudi akamjovela, “Ngati ukahamba pamonga na nene, yati ukuning'aha nene. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Nambu ngati ukawuyayi ku Yelusalemu na kumjovela Abusalomu, ‘Veve nkosi, nene yati nivya mtumisi waku ngati chenavili mtumisi wa dadi waku kadeni.’ Kwa kukita chenicho yati ukita maholo ga Ahitofeli gakotoka kutimila. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Mteta Sadoki na Abiatali yati vivya pamonga na veve kwenuko ku Yelusalemu. Chochoha cheuyuwana kuhuma mu nyumba ya nkosi vajovela mteta Sadokina na Abiatali. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Vana vavi vavili, Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki na Yonatani mwana wa Abiatali, vavii pamonga na vene kwenuko. Chochoha cheuyuwanayi, vatuma vabwela kunimanyisa.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Hinu Hushai, mkozi wa nkosi Daudi, akawuya ku Yelusalemu lukumbi Abusalomu peayingilayi mu muji wenuwo.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Siba ikonganeka na nkosi Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daudi peahegalili palongolo chidogo kuhuma pachituvilu cha chitumbi akakonganeka na Siba mtumisi wa Mefibosheti akumlindila, akampokela kuni avi na punda zaki zivili zezitandikwi kuni zigegi mabumunda miya zivili na keki miya yimonga zezitenganizwi kwa zabibu ziyumu na keke miya yimonga zezitenganizwi kwa tini na kahaku ka chikumba kekamemii divayi. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Nkosi Daudi akamkota Siba, “Ndava kyani uletili vindu ivi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba akamyangula, “Punda ndi ndava ya kukwela vandu va munyumba yaku, mabumunda na matunda yati vilya vandu voha na divayi ndava ya kuvasangalusa vandu vevitotokela kulukongolo.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Kangi nkosi akamkota “Avi kwoki Mefibosheti mjukulu wa mkulu waku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Siba akamyangula nkosi, “Mwene asigali ku Yelusalemu muni iholalela kuvya vandu va Isilaeli yati vakumuwuyasila unkosi wa Sauli gogo waki.”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Nkosi akamjovela Siba, “Vindu vila vyevyavili vya Mefibosheti hinu ndi vindu vyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Siba akamjovela, “Usengwili mkulu wangu, nene niyupa niyidakiliwa palongolo yaku magono goha bambu wangu nkosi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei akumpela likoto Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Lukumbi nkosi Daudi peahegalili ku Bahulimu, ahumalili mundu mmonga wa lukolo lwa Sauli, liina laki Shimei mwana wa Gela, mundu mwenuyo akatumbula kumpela likoto Daudi changaleka. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Shimei akavajugumila maganga Daudi na vatumisi vaki, pamonga kuvya valonda vamtindila kuupandi wa mangeha na wa kulyelela. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei ampelili likoto na kujova, “Wuka! Hamba uko! Veve mweukoma vandu! Veve mwewangaganikiwa kwa chindu chochoha! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Bambu Chapanga akulipisili mbunu ndava ya vandu voha va munyumba ya Sauli vewavakomili, na utolili unkosi waki. Hinu Bambu Chapanga ampelili unkosi Abusalomu mwana waku. Lola, wenuwu ndi mwisu waku veve wamukomaji.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Ndi Abishai, mwana mau mweikemiwa Seluya, akamjovela nkosi, “Veve mkulu, ndava kyani mundu uyu mweavii ngati libwa lelifwili akupela likoto? Leka nene nihamba nikamdumula mutu waki!”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Nambu nkosi akavajovela, “Ndi kuna kyani pagati yangu na nyenye mwavana va Seruya? Yikavyai Bambu Chapanga amjovili Shimei, ‘mpela Daudi likoto,’ wu, ndi yani hinu ihotola kukota, ‘Ndava kyani ikita chenichi?’ ” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Kangi nkosi Daudi akamjovela Abishai na vatumisi vaki voha, “Yikavya mwana wangu namwene igana kunikoma, yivya wuli kwa mundu uyu wa likabila la Benyamini? Nyenye mumlekayi anipela likoto muni Bambu Chapanga amulagazili anipela likoto. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Pangi Bambu Chapanga yati ilola kubuda kwangu na mwene yati akunilipa gabwina ndava ya likoto lenipewili lelu.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Hinu nkosi Daudi na vandu vaki vakayendelela na lugendu lwavi kuchitumbi na shimei agendayi mumihana ya chitumbi kulolesana na Daudi kuni akumtagila nkosi Daudi maganga na lububu. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Kangi nkosi pamonga na vandu vaki voha vevavi pamonga na mwene, vakahika mumihana ya mfuleni Yoludani kuni vatotokili neju. Ndi vakapumulila.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hushai na Ahitofili vakumpela ushauli Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Abusalomu na vandu voha va ku Isilaeli vakahamba ku muji wa Yelusalemu, na Ahitofeli avi pamonga na vene. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Hushai kuhuma ku Aliki, mkozi wa Daudi, akamuhambila Abusalomu, akamjovela, “Uvyai na wumi utali! Utama wumi wa magono gamahele nkosi!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Absolamu akamkota Hushai, “Wu, Wenuwu ndi ubwina waku weuyendelela kusindimala weukumlangisa mkozi waku Daudi? Mbona wahambili lepi pamonga na mkozi waku?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai akamyangula, “Lepi! Muni yula mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga, na mweahaguliwi na vandu ava na vandu voha va ku Isilaeli, mwenuyo ndi mwenivya pamonga naku. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Neju ya genago, nene nimuhengela yani? Wu, lepi mwana wa bambu wangu? Yati nikukuhenela veve ngati chenamuhengelayi dadi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Hinu Abusalomu akamujovela Ahitofeli, “Hinu tivili peapa, unijovela tikita kyani?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli akamjovela Abusalomu, “Hambayi ukagona na vadala va kuvala va dadi waku veavalekili vayangalila nyumba ya chinkosi. Ndi vandu voha va ku Isilaeli peviyuwana kuvya veve umuyomisi dadi waku, penapo vandu voha vevavi pamonga na veve yati vipata makakala.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Hinu vandu vakatendekela lindanda ku chituvilu ya nyumba ya nkosi ndava ya Abusalomu, na mwene akagona na vadala va kuvala va dadi waki, kuni vandu voha va ku Isilaeli vakuvawona.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Magono genago, chochoha cheajovili Ahitofeli chawonakini ngati ajoviwi na Chapanga. Mewa chayidakiliwi na Daudi pamonga na Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai akumkonga Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Pa genago, Ahitofeli amjovili Abusalomu, “Niyupa nihagulayi vandu elufu kumi na vavili, niwuka navu kumlandalila Daudi kilu iyi. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Yati nimzangila peivya atotokili na adenyiki mtima. Na nene yati nikumuyogopesa, na vandu vaki voha yati vitila. Yati nimkoma nkosi ndu, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kuvawuyisa vandu vangi voha kwaku ngati mdala cheihamba kwa mngana waki. Na vandu voha veukuvagana yati vitama cha uteke.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Chenicho cheajovili Ahitofeli chawonikini kuvya chabwina neju kwa Absolamu na vagogo voha va Vaisilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Kangi Abusalomu akajova, “Mewawa mkemelayi Hushai, mweihumila ku Aliki timuyuwanila na mwene cheijova.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai peabwelili, Abusalomu akamjovela, “Chenichi ndi cheajovili Ahitofeli, wu tikitayi ngati cheatijovili? Ngati lepi, tijovela cheuwona veve.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai akayangula, “Cheajovili Ahitofeli kwa hinu ndi chabwina lepi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Veve umanyili njwee kuvya dadi waku Daudi na vandu vaki chevavii vakekesi na hinu ndi vakali ngati chinyama chechikemiwa dubu chechinyagiwi vana vaki kudahi. Mewa umanyili kuvya dadi waku ndi linjolinjoli mweayovalili kutovana ngondo, ihotola lepi kutama pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki kilu yoha. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Hata hinu amalili kujihiha mu mbugu amala pandu pangi. Ngati yati itumbula kuvazangila manjolinjoli vaku, yoyoha mweiyuwana mambu genago yati ijova manjolinjoli vamahele vevakumlanda Abusalomu vakomiwi. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Hata mundu mkekesi mweangayogopa ngati lihimba, yati iyogopa ndava kila mundu ku Isilaeli amanyili kuvya dadi waku ndi linjolinjoli likulu na kuvya vandu vevavii pamonga naku ndi vandu vakekesi. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Hinu chenikujovela nene ndi ichi, uvakemelayi Vaisilaeli voha pamonga vevavii ku Dani yeyivii ku kasikazini mbaka vevavii ku Beeli Sheba yeyivii upandi wa kusini, vevavii vamahele ngati msavati wa kumbwani na veve wamwene uhamba pamonga navu ku ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Ndi petikumzangila Daudi popoha peavili, na kumgwilila ngati mbetu cheugwa pandima. Kawaka mundu mweisigalila mumi yikavya mwene amala vandu vaki. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Ngati yati itilalila ku muji wowoha, vandu voha va ku Isilaeli yati vileta nyosi na kuutindisila muji woha na kuuhuta mbaka kunyasi, chikoto kusigalila chindu chochoa hati liganga lidebe ku chitumbi chenicho.<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abusalomu na vandu voha va ku Isilaeli vakajova, “Cheajovili Ushai ndi chabwina kuliku cheajovili Ahitofeli.” Muni Bambu Chapanga aganayi kuvya gala mambu gabwina geavajovili Ahitofeli gakotoka kuhumalila, muni amkomakesa Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ilakaliwa na itila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Kangi Hushai akavajovela vamteta Sadoki na Abiatali kuvya, “Ahitofeli avajovili vagogo voha va Isilaeli vakitayi aga na aga nambu nene nivajovili vakita naha na naha. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Hinu mukita kanyata mupeleka ujumbi kwa Daudi, mumjovela naa, ‘Kilu iyi ukoto kugona ku mitandu ku lukongolo, nambu uyomboka mfuleni Yoludani, ngati lepi nkosi pamonga na vandu voha vevavili pamonga na mwene yati vizangiwa na kukomiwa.’”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonatani mwana wa Abiatali na Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki vajihihili pa chinyepa cha Enilogeli pavala ya Yelusalemu, muni vakoto kuwonekana paviyingila mu muji. Mtumisi mmonga wa chidala akalihamba kuvajovela mambu gegahumalili, na vene vakalihamba kumjovela nkosi Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Nambu msongolo mmonga avaweni, msongolo mwenuyo akahamba kumjovela Abusalomu. Ndi Yonatani na Ahimaasi vakawuka kanyata, vakahamba kujihiha mu nyumba ya mundu mmonga uko ku Bahulimu. Mundu mwenuyo avii na chiliva mu uwa yaki, na vene vakayingila mu chiliva chenicho na kujihiha. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mdala wa mkolonyumba yeniyo akatola chigubiku na kugubika chiliva chenicho, kangi akatandika mpasa na kuyanikila mabenu panani yaki. Kawaka mundu mweamanyili chindu chochoha. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Manjolinjoli va Abusalomu pevahikili kwa mdala mwenuyo, vakamkota, “Vavi kwoki Ahimaasi na Yonatani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Mdala yula akavayangula, “Vayombwiki kumwambu ya kapela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Manjolinjoli vakahamba kuvalonda nambu vavaweni lepi. Ndi vakawuya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Vatumisi va Absolamu pevawukili, Yonatani na Ahimaasi vahumili mu chiliva, vakahamba kwa nkosi Daudi na kumjovela, “Wukayi, uyomboka mfuleni hinu naa, ndava muni Ahitofeli amjovili Abusolamu mpangu uhakau kukuvala veve.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Ndi Daudi na vandu vaki voha vakatumbula kuyomboka mfuleni Yoludani. Pekwachili, vandu voha vavii vamali kuyomboka mfuleni Yoludani.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli peawene kuvya cheavajovili vakitili lepi, akakwela lipunda laki, akahamba kunyumba yaki uko ku muji waki. Peahikili kwenuko, avikili bwina mambu ga munyumba yaki, kangi akajiyinjisa. Akafwa na akazikiwa mu litinda la dadi waki.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Hinu Daudi akahika ku muji wa Mahanaimu, lukumbi Absolamu na Vaisilaeli viyomboka mfuleni Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Lukumbi lwenulo, Abusolamu amvikili Amasa kuvya mkulu wa manjolinjoli pahala pa Yoabu. Amasa avi mwana wa Yeteli, kuhuma mu lukolo lwa Ishimaeli. Nyina waki akemiwi Abigali msikana wa Nahashi, na mwenuyo Nahashi avii mlumbu waki Seluya, nyina waki Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abusalomu pamonga na manjolinjoli va Isilaeli vavikili kambi yavi mu mulima wa Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daudi peahikili ku Mahanaimu, akonganiki na Shobi mwana wa Nahashi wa kuhuma ku muji wa Laba mu mulima wa Vaamoni, Makili mwana wa Amieli kuhuma ku Lodebali, pamonga na Balizilai kuhuma ku Gileadi ku muji wa Logelimu. <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />Vandu venava valetili mipasa na nkeve na viviga na nganu na shayili na uhembe na mandulutulu na mandondo na nandala, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />na wuchi na mavele gegagandiswi na mambelele na mahuta ga hinyama kuhuma mu mifuya yavi. Vindu vyenivyo vyoha vamuletili Daudi na vandu vevavili pamonga na mwene. Ndava vajovili, “Vandu venava vananjala, vatotokili na vananjoto uko ku lukongolo.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Nkosi Daudi avakonganisi manjolinjoli vaki voha pamonga, avagavanisi mu misambi ya vandu elufu yimonga kuni vilongoswa na vachilongosi vavi, na misambi ya vandu miya yimonga kuni vilongoswa na vachilongosi vavi. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi avatumili manjolinjoli vaki ku ngondo kuni avagavanisi mu misambi hidatu, msambi wa kutumbu walongwiswi na Yoabu na msambi wa pili walongwiswi na Abishai mwana waki Seluya mbena wa Yoabu na msambi wa datu walongwiswi na Itai mundu kuhuma ku Gati. Na nkosi akavajovela vandu vaki, “Nene yati nihamba pamonga na nyenye kungondo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Nambu manjolinjoli vakamjovela, “Veve kotoka kuhamba na tete, ngati tete yati tijumba yati vakutilandalila lepi. Hati yapinga yitu tikafwayi yati vakuliwona lijambu la ngali mana. Veve uganikiwa neju kuliku manjolinjoli elufu kumi. Chabwina veve usigalila pa muji, na yati ukutitangatila kuwuka penapa pa muji.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Nkosi akavajovela, “Yati nikita chochoa chachilolekana chabwina.” Ndi nkosi akayima papipi na lilyangu kuni misambi yaki ya manjolinjoli maelufu na mamiya pevahumanyi. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Nkosi Daudi akavalagiza Yoabu na Abishai na Itai, akavajovela, “Mumuwonela lipyana msongolo mdebe Abusalomu ndava ya nene.” Manjolinjoli voha vamuyuwini Daudi peavalagizayi vachilongosi va manjolinjoli kumvala Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Manjolinjoli va Daudi vakahamba ku lukongolo vakatovana na vandu va Izilaeli ku dasi ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Vaisilaeli vakabuniwa na manjolinjoli va Daudi, vandu vevakomiwi ligono lenilo vavi ngati elufu ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Ngondo yeniyo yadandasiki mu mulima woha, na vandu vamahele vafwilili ku dasi ligono lenilo kuliku vala vevakomiwi na upanga ku ngondo.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Hinu Abusalomu kuni akwelili lipunda falasi laki akakonganeka na vatumisi va Daudi. Lipunda falasi lenilo pelapitayi pahi ya mambanda ga chikongo chivaha cha mwaloni, mayunju ga Abusalomu gakajinyemba mu mambanda ga mwaloni. Abusalomu alekiwi iyinjila kuni lipunda falasi laki layendalelayi kujumba. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Mmonga wa vandu va Daudi amuwene na kumjovela Yoabu, “Nimuwene Abusalomu iyinjila mu chikongo cha mwaloni!”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu akamyangula mundu mwenuyo, “Kyani? Umuweni Abusalomu? Ndava kyani wamubunili lepi na kumukoma? Namwene nganikupelili ipandi kumi ya madini ga feza na mkungi wa kuvya linjolinjoli mkekesi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Nambu mundu yula akayangula, “Hata ngati ukanipelayi nene ipandi elufu yimonga ya madini ga feza, nganikwesili lepi chiwoko nimukoma mwana wa nkosi, Muni tayuwini nkosi cheakulagisi veve na Abishai na Itai peajovili, ‘Mumuwonela lipyana msongolo mdebe Abusalomu ndava ya nene.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Na ngati ngenikotoka kumuyidakila nkosi na kumkoma Abusalomu mwana waki, mwene ngaamanyili kila chindu muni kusi chindu chochoha chechihihika kwaki, hati veve wamwene ngaunikengelili lepi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu akamjovela, “Nigana lepi kuhovesa lukumbi kuyendelela kulongela na veve.” Penapo Yoabu akatola nduta zidatu, akahamba kumuhoma Abusalomu pa mtima. Yoabu peahambayi kumuhoma, akamukolela Abusalomu akona mumi na akona iyinjila mu limbanda la mwaloni. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Ndi vasongolo kumi vevamgegili Yoabu vindu vya ngondo vakamtindila Abusalomu, vakamtova na kumkoma.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Kangi Yoabu akalipyula lipenenga, na manjolinjoli voha vakawuya kuhuma mukuvalandalila Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Vakayitola higa ya Abusalomu, vakayitaga mulilindi litali kudasi na vakayilundikila lilundu livaha la maganga, Vaisilaeli voha vakatila, kila mundu akatilalila ku nyumba yaki.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Lukumbi lwa wumi waki, Abusalomu ajengili lipanda laki ku likemba la nkosi, muni avi lepi na mwana mgosi wa kukita liina laki likumbukwayi. Lipanda lenilo akalikemela liina laki mwene, mbaka lelu ndi likemelewa lipanda la Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi ijoviwa kufwega kwa Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Kangi Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki akamjovela Yoabu, “Leka nene nijumbai kwa nkosi na ujumbi wabwina kuvya Bambu Chapanga amgombwili kuhuma mu makoko vaki.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu akamjovela, “Lelu veve yati upeleka lepi ujumbi wenuwu. Uhotola kupeleka ujumbi ligono lingi, nambu lelu uganikiwa lepi kupeleka, ndava mwana wa nkosi afwili.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ndi Yoabu akamjovela mtumisi waki mweahumali ku Esiopia, “Hambai na ukamujovelayi nkosi chauchiwene.” Ndi mtumisi akamfugamila Yoabu, akawuka na kujumba.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki akamjovela kangi Yoabu, “Leka lihumila loloha lila, nikuyupa unileka nimjumbalila Muesiopia yula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Yoabu akamkota, “Ndava kyani ugana kuhamba mwana wangu? Yati upata lepi njombi ndava ya kupeleka ujumbi wenuwu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi akajova kangi, “Nene nigana kuhamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Yoabu akamjovela, “Aya uhambayi.” Ndi Ahimaasi akajumba akapita njila yingi ya ku likemba la mfuleni Yolodani, akampita Muesiopia yula.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Daudi peavi atamili pagati ya Limlyangu la mugati na la kuvala la muji. Mlonda wa lilyangu akakwela ku luwumba mbaka kunani ya mlyangu, na peakwesili mihu gaki, amuwene mundu ijumba mwene. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Mlonda mwenuyo akakemela na kumjovela nkosi, na nkosi akajova, “Ngati avi mwene, akutiletela ujumbi wabwina.” Mundu yula akayendelela kuhegelela papipi.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Mlonda kuni avili kunani ya mylyangu akakemela kavili, akajova, “Lola! Kuna mundu yungi ijumba avili mwene!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Nkosi akamyangula, “Na mwene mewa akutiletela ujumbi wabwina.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Mlonda yula akajova kangi, “Cheniwona yula mweamlongolili myaki ijumba ngati Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Nkosi akajova, “Mwenuyo ndi mundu wa bwina, akutiletela ujumbi wabwina.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Penapo Ahimaasi akamjovela nkosi kwa lwami luvaha, “Mambu goha gavii gabwina.” Akafugama palongolo ya nkosi na kugundama mbaka pahi akajova, “Atopeswa Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, mweakusangwili kuhuma kwa vandu vevang'anamwiki kuubela unkosi waku veve nkosi!”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Nkosi akakota, “Wu, msongolo Abusalomu avi bwina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaasi akayangula, “Yoabu peanitumili nene mtumisi waku, nawene msambi uvaha wa vandu vikita chitututu, nambu nimanyili lepi chihumalili kyani.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Nkosi akamjovela, “Yima pamuhana ulindilayi.” Hinu Ahimaasi akahegelela pamuhana, akayima penapo.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Ndi mvanda Muesiopia akahika na kumjovela nkosi, “Nivi na ujumbi wabwina ndava yaku bambu wangu nkosi! Lelu Bambu Chapanga akusangwili kuhuma kwa vandu voha vevang'anamwiki kuubela unkosi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Nkosi akamkota, “Wu, msongolo Abusalomu avi bwina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Muesiopia yula akayangula, “Veve nkosi wangu, vamakoko vaku pamonga na voha vevang'anamwiki kukubela vakagana gakukolela gahakau, gavakolela ngati gegamkolili msongolo mwenuyo Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Nkosi akavya na mvinisu neju. Ahambili mbaka kuchumba chachivi panani ya lilyangu na kuvemba. Peakwelayi avembayi na kujova, “Veve mwana wangu! Mwana wangu Abusalomu! Abusalomu, mwana wangu! mbanga nganifwili nene, veve uvya mumi, Abusalomu, mwana wangu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yoabu akumlakalila nkosi Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu ajoviwi kuvya nkosi Daudi ivemba na kuvembeneka ndava ya kufwa kwa Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Ndava yeniyo, luheku lwa uhotola lwang'anamwiki kuvya kuvembeneka kwa manjolinjoli voha va Daudi ligono lenilo, muni vayuwini kuvya nkosi ivembeneka ndava ya mwana waki. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ligono lenilo vakawuya ku muji chinunu, ngati vamanjolinjoli veviwona soni ndava ya kutila ngondo. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Nkosi akajigubika pamihu paki na kuvemba kwa lwami luvaha, kuni ijova, “Yoyo mwana wangu Abusalomu! Yoyo Abusalomu, mwana wangu!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Yoabu akahamba ku nyumba ya nkosi na kumjovela, “Lelu utipeli soni tavandu vaku tavoha, vandu vevasangwili wumi waku na wumi wa vasongolo vaku na wa vasikana vaku na wa vadala vaku na wa vadala vaku va kuvala. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Veve uvagana vala vevakuvenga na uvavenga vala vevakugana. Hinu ulangisi hotohoto kuvya vakulu va manjolinjoli vaku na vandu vavi vana mana lepi kwa veve. Nilola kuvya, lelu ngati Abusalomu ngeivya mumi, na tete tavoha ngativili tifwili, veve ngauhekalili. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Hinu yimai uhamba ukavapolesa mtima vatumisi vaku. Muni nilapila kwa Bambu Chapanga kuvya ngati uhamba lepi kuvapolesa mitima, kawaka hata mmonga mwaisigalila pamonga na veve kilu iyi. Lijambu lenili yati livya mbunu uvaha kwa veve kuliku gahakau goha gegakupatili kuhuma usongolo waku mbaka lelu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Ndi nkosi akayima, akahamba na kutama papipi na lilyangu la muji. Vandu voha pevayuwini kuvya nkosi atamili pa mlyangu, vakamuhambila kuhuma kunyumba zavi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Daudi akujitendekeha kuwuya ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Lukumbi lwenulo Vaizilaeli voha vevavili pamonga na Abusalomu vajumbalile ku nyumba zavi.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Vandu va makabila goha ga Izilaeli vakalijovesana vene kwa vene, kuni vijova, “Nkosi Daudi atigombwili mumawoko ga vamakoko vitu, atigombwili mu mawoko ga Vafilisti. Nambu hinu aujumbili mulima, amtila Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Hinu mwenuyo Abusalomu mwetamunyalili mahuta avyai nkosi witu, hinu akomiwi ku ngondo. Hinu ndava kyani tilongelela lepi kuvala kumuwuyisa nkosi Daudi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Nkosi Daudi atumili ujumbi kwa vamteta Sadoki na Abiathali kuvya, “Muvakotayi vagogo va ku Yuda, ‘Ndava kyani nyenye muvyai va mwishu kumuwuyisa nkosi ku nyumba yaki ya chinkosi? Mambu goha gevajovili Vaizilaeli voha, gamuhikalili nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Nyenye ndi mwavalongo vangu, nyenye na nene gogo witu mmonga, ndava kyani muvyai vamwishu kuniwuyisa nene nkosi?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Mumkotayi mewa Amasa, ‘Wu, veve na nene gogo witu mmonga lepi? Kangi Chapanga anikomayi ngati yati nikukita lepi uvya mkulu wa vamanjolinjoli vangu pahala pa Yoabu.’” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Daudi ayikitili mitima ya vandu voha va ku Yuda himuyidakila vakavya ngati mundu mmonga. Hinu vakampelekela ujumbi weujova, “Wuya kunyumba, veve na vatumisi vaku voha.”<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Hinu nkosi atumbwili kuwuya, na peahikili ku mfuleni Yolodani, vandu va ku Yuda vahambili ku Giligali kumpokela nkosi, kangi vakamyombosa mu mfuleni Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimei mwana wa Gela wa likabila la Benjamini kuhuma ku Bahulimu, akabwela kanyata muni awungana na vandu vangi kumpokela nkosi Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimei ahambili pamonga na Vabenyamini elufu yimonga kuni valongosini na Siba mtumisi wa vandu va munyumba ya Sauli, pamonga na vana vaki kumi na vatumisi ishilini, vahambili kanyata ku mfuleni Yolodani kwakona na nkosi Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Vakayomboka mfuleni kuvahindakisa vandu va nkosi kuyomboka na kukita kila chindu chaigana nkosi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Daudi akumulekekesa Shimei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Nkosi peavi papipi kuyomboka mfuleni Yolodani, Shimei mwana wa Gela akabwela akafugama na kugundama mbaka pahi cha kutopesa palongolo ya nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei akamjovela nkosi, “Chondi Bambu wangu nkosi, nikuyupa ukoto kukumbuka kuhoka kwenakukitili ligono lila lewawukili ku Yelusalemu. Kotoka kugavika mu mtima waku. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Nene mtumisi waku nimanyili kuvya nibudili, ndi mana lelu namundu wa kutumbula wa likabila la Yosefu, kubwela kukupokela veve bambu wangu nkosi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Abishai mwana wa Seluya akajova, “Shimei yikumgana akomiwayi ndava muni ampeli likoto mundu yula mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga kwa kumnyunyusila mahuta avya nkosi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Nambu Daudi akamjovela Abishai na Yoabu muhaja waki, “Yani mweakujovili unitangatilayi? Ugana kuniletela matatizu? Hinu nene ndi nkosi wa Izilaeli na kawaka Muizilaeli mweakomiwayi lelu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Nkosi akamjovela Shimei, “Veve yati ukomiwa lepi.” Nkosi akamlapila Shimei.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akumuwonela lipyana Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosheti mjukulu wa Sauli, akabwela kumpokela nkosi Daudi. Asanjili lepi magendelu gaki amala kuketa manjwemba gaki amala kuchapa nyula zaki kuhuma ligono lila nkosi peawukili ku Yelusalemu mbaka ligono leawuyili cha uteke. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Lukumbi Mefibosheti peawukili ku Yelusalemu kubwela kumpokela nkosi, nkosi akamkota, “Mefibosheti, ndava kyani wahambili lepi pamonga na nene?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti akayangula, “Mkulu wangu nkosi, ngati chaumanyili nene mtumisi waku nina chilema, namjovili mtumisi wangu anitandikila lipunda niwukayi pamonga na veve. Nambu Siba mtumisi wangu aning'anamukili. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Hinu anijovalili kwa veve nkosi. Nambu veve nkosi wangu uvi na luhala ngati mtumu wa Chapanga, hinu kitayi chochoha cheuchiwona chabwina. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Valongo voha va vadadi wangu vavi vandu veviganikiwa kukomiwa njwee palongolo yaku, mkulu wangu nkosi. Nambu wanivikili nene mtumisi waku pagati ya vala vevilya pamonga na veve munyumba yaku. Wu, niganikiwa kuyendelela kujitetela palongolo yaku veve nkosi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Nkosi akamuyangula, “Ndava kyani ujova gengo goha? Nimali kulagiza veve na Siba mugavana migunda ya Sauli.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefibosheti akamjovela nkosi, “Mleka Siba atolayi migunda yoha yivya yaki mwene, chabwina kwa nene ndi kukuwona veve nkosi uwuyili bwina ku nyumba.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amkitila gabwina Balizilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Balizilai wa kuhuma ku Gileadi, mewa akabwela kuhuma ku muji wa Logelimu kumuhindikisa nkosi kuyomboka mfuleni Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Balizilai avi mgogolo neju, avi na myaka semanini. Avi na vindu vyamahele neju na ampelili nkosi chakulya lukumbi lwoha lweatamili ku Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Nkosi Daudi akamjovela Balizilai, “Tihambai pamonga na nene ku Yelusalemu, na yati nikuyangalila.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Nambu Balizilai akamyangula nkosi, “Nina magono lepi gamahele ga kuvya mumi, ndava kyani nihambai pamonga na veve nkosi ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Nene nina myaka semanini, nihotola kusiganisa gabwina na gahakau? Wu, nihotola kumanya kunoga kwa chakulya amala mnyweso? Wu, nihotola kuyuwanila bwina lwami lwa vayimbaji vagosi na vadala? Ndava kyani nene mtumisi waku nivya mzigu kwaku veve bambu wangu nkosi? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Nene mtumisi waku yati niyomboka na veve mfuleni Yolodani na kukuhindikisa chidogo mbaka. Nambu ndava kyani nkosi ukunipela njombi yeniyi yivaha. <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nikuyupa unileka nene mtumisi waku niwuya muni nifwilila mu muji wangu namwene papipi na litinda la dadi na nyina wangu. Nambu avii peapa mwana mtumisi waku Kimihamu, mleka ayomboka na veve bambu wangu nkosi. Umuhengelayi chochoha cheuwona veve chabwina.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Nkosi akamuyangula, “Nene yati nihamba na Kimihamu na kumkitila chochoha chechikuganisa. Na chindu chochoha chewigana nikukitila, yati nikukitila.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ndi Daudi na vandu vaki voha vakayomboka mfuleni Yolodani. Nkosi amkumbatili chauganu na kummotisa Balizilai, na mwene Balizilai akawuya ku nyumba yaki.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu va ku Yuda na ku Isilaeli vijovesana kumvala nkosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Lukumbi nkosi peayombwiki mfuleni kuhamba ku Giligali, Kimihamu akayomboka nayu. Vandu voha va Yuda na yapinga ya vandu va Isilaeli vamuhindikisayi nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Kangi vandu voha va Isilaeli vakabwela kwa nkosi na kumjovela, “Ndava kyani valongo vitu vandu va Yuda vakutolili chimfiyu pewavili mu njila, na vakakuyombosa mfuleni Yolodani, veve na vandu va myumba yaku, pamonga na vandu vaku voha?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Vandu va ku Yuda vakavayangula vandu va Izilaeli, “Takitili chenicho muni nkosi ndi mlongo witu. Ndava kyani muyoma ndava ya lijambu lenili? Wu, tilili chindu chochoha cha nkosi? Wu, atipelili njombi yoyoha?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Vaisilaeli vakavayangula vandu va Yuda, “Daudi iganikiwa kuvya nkosi witu mala kumi neju kuliku nyenye. Ndava kyani mwativevisi? Wu, tete tavi lepi va kutumbula kujova kuvya nkosi witu awuyiswayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Nambu vandu va Yuda valongili malovi ga kuvinisa kuliku vandu va ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba amng'anamukila nkosi Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Hinu kwavili na mundu muhakau ku Gileadi liina laki Sheba mwana wa Bikili wa likabila la Benjamini, hinu akapyula lipenenga na kujova, “Tivi lepi na chitu kwa Daudi, tivi lepi na pandu pitu popoha kwa mwenuyo mwana wa Yese. Nyenye vana va Isilaeli kila mmonga ahamba kunyumba yaki!” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Hinu vandu voha va Isilaeli vakamleka Daudi na kumlanda Sheba mwana wa Bikili. Nambu vandu va Yuda vasigalili kuvya vasadikika na vakamlanda nkosi Daudi kuhuma ku mfuleni Yolodani mbaka ku muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Daudi peahikili ku nyumba yaki ya chinkosi ku muji wa Yelusalemu, akavatola vadala waki kumi va kuvala veavalekili vayangalila nyumba yaki, akavavika mu nyumba yimonga pahi ya ulonda, akavayangalila bwina nambu agoni lepi nawu. Hinu vadala venavo vavikiwi mugati mbaka ligono la kufwa kwavi, vatamili ngati valipwela.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Kangi nkosi akamjovela Amasa, “Vakemela vandu voha va Yuda vabwela penapa mu magono gadatu na wamwene uvyayi penapo.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Hinu Amasa akahamba kuvakemela vandu va Yuda. Nambu awuyili lepi mulukumbi lweajoviwi na Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi akamjovela Abishai, “Hinu, Sheba mwana wa Bikili, yati akutiyokisa neju kuliku Abusalomu. Tola vatumisi vangu umlandalila Sheba muni akoto kuyingila mu miji yeyitindisiwi luwumba lwa maganga.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Abishai akawuka na Yoabu pamonga na valonda va nkosi na vakekesi voha. Venavo voha vawukili ku Yelusalemu vakahamba kumlonda Sheba mwana wa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Pevahikili pa litalau livaha kwenuko ku Gibeoni, Amasa akahuma kuvapokela. Yoabu awalili ligwanada la manjolinjoli na panani ya ligwanda lenilo kwavili na mkungi wewakamulili kahaku kekavili chipula chivaha mu chiwunu chaki. Yoabu peahegelili, chipula chaki chaholomwiki, chikagwa pahi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu akamjovela Amasa, “Wu, wilama mlongo wangu?” Yoabu akagakamula manjwemba ga Amasa na kumuhuta muni amkumbatila chauganu. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Nambu Amasa achiweni lepi chipula chechavili mu mawoko ga Yoabu. Hinu Yoabu akamuhoma nachu pa lutumbu na matumbu gaki gakaseyewukila kuvala na kugwa pahi, Amasa akafwa balapala changali Yoabu kumuhoma kavili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Kangi Yoabu na Abishai mlongo waki vakayendelela kumlandalila Sheba mwana wa Bikili.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Mundu mmonga wa Yoabu akayima papipi na higa ya Amasa, akajova, “Yoyoha mweakumgana Yoabu na yoyoha mweakumgana Daudi, amulandayi Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa afwili kuni atepatili ngasi yaki higa yoha pagati ya njila yikulu. Hinu kila mweapita penapo ayima kumlola. Nambu mundu mmonga peaweni kuvya vandu voha vabwelili na kuyima pandu penapo, akayiwusa higa ya Amasa pa njila, akayipeleka kudasi na kuyigubika kwa nyula. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Higa ya Amasa peyawusiwi pa njila, vandu voha vahambili na Yoabu kumlandalila Sheba mwana wa Bikili.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba apitili mu makabila goha ga Izilaeli mbaka ku muji wa Abeli Beti Maaka. Vandu voha va pandu pepikemiwa Bikili vaganiswi, vakonganiki pamonga na kumlanda Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Manjolinjoli voha vevavili pamonga na Yoabu vakahamba kumzangila Sheba peavili mu muji wenuwo wa Abeli Beti Maaka. Vakatumbula kulundika ludaka pa muhana ya luwumba kuvya pandu pa kukwelela, kangi vakatumbula kubomola luwumba na kuugwisa pahi. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Kangi mdala mmonga mweavi na luhala ayuwaniki kuhuma mu muji, ijova, “Muyuwanila! Muyuwanila! Mumjovela Yoabu abwela nilongela nayu.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu akahamba papipi yake, mdala yula akamjovela, “Wu, veve ndi Yoabu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoabu akajova, “Ena! ndi nene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Mdala yula akamjovela, “Niyuwanila nene mtumisi waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoabu akamjovela, “Nikuyuwanila.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Mdala yula akamjovela, “Penapo kadeni vandu vajovayi, ‘Muhamba mukayuwanila cheviyangula ku muji wa Abeli.’ Chenicho ndi vandu chevahotwili kumala mihalu yavi. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Nene ndi mmonga wa vala vevigana uteke na usadika pa Izilaeli. Hinu veve ugana kuhalabisa muji weuvi ngati mau pa Izilaeli. Ndava kyani ugana kuhalabisa muji wa Bambu Chapanga?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu akamuyangula, “Katu muwumi wangu! Nigana lepi kuleta chitututu amala kubomola muji waku. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Geujovili gachakaka lepi! Nambu mundu mmonga kuhuma ku hitumbi ya Efulahimu mwaikemiwa Sheba mwana wa Bikili, atumbwili kung'namuka na kumbela nkosi Daudi. Mumuleta kwa nene, penapo ndi yati niwuka pa muji winu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Mdala yula akamjovela Yoabu, “Mutu waki yati ujugumiwa kwaku kupitila luwumba.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Penapo mdala yula akahamba kulongela kwa luhala na vandu voha va muji cheviganikiwa kukita. Hinu vakamdumula mutu Sheba mwana wa Bikili, vakautaga kuvala kwa Yoabu. Hinu Yoabu akapula lipenenga kulangisa kuvya ngondo yimaliki. Vandu vakapechenganika kuhuma mu muji wenuwo wa Abeli, kila mundu akawuya ku nyumba yaki. Kangi Yoabu akawuya kwa nkosi Daudi, ku muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vevamtangatili Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Hinu Yoabu akavya mkulu wa manjolinjoli voha pa Isilaeli. Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, avili mkulu wa valonda va nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adolamu avili mweiyimamila vandu vevahenga mahengu ga kung'ang'aniswa. Yehoshafati mwana wa Ahiludi avili myandikaji wa kumbukumbu. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shausha avili muyandikaji wa nkosi, Sadoki na Abiatali vavili vamteta vakulu. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ila kuhuma ku muji wa Yaili avili mteta mweamuhengelayi Daudi mwene.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Vachiveleku va Sauli vikomiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Lukumbi lwa utalalila wa Daudi kwavili na njala yivaha mu myaka hidatu, hinu Daudi akamyupa Bambu Chapanga, na mwene Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Daudi, “Njala yeniyo yibwelili ndava Sauli na vandu va munyumba yaki vavakomili Vagibioni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Hinu nkosi Daudi akavakemela Vagibioni akalongela navu. Vagibioni vavi lepi Vaizilaeli nambu vavi masigalilu ga Vaamoli. Pamonga kuvya vandu va Izilaeli valapili kuvaleka mumi Vagibioni, nambu Sauli alingili kuvakomakesa voha ndava aganayi vandu va Izilaleli na Yuda vautalalilayi mulima woha. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daudi akavakota Vagibioni, “Nivakitila kyani? Yati nikuvalipa wuli ndava ya uhakau wemukitiwi muni muhotola kuumotisa mulima uwu na vandu vaki Bambu Chapanga?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Vagibioni vakamjovela, “Luhonda lwitu na Sauli pamonga na vandu va munyumba yaki luhotola lepi kumalika kwa kulipa madini ga feza amala zahabu, amala kwa tete kumkoma Muizilaeli yoyoha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Nkosi akavakota kangi, “Wu, mwigana nivakitila kyani?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Vene vakamyangula nkosi, “Sauli aganayi kutikomakesa njwee, na akoto kumuleka mumi mundu yoyoha pagati yitu pandu popoha pa Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Hinu, tipela vachiveleku vaki saba vagosi tivakoma cha kuvakungila palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga ku chitumbi cha Gibea, ku muji wa Sauli mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga kwa kuyitiwa mahuta avya nkosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Nkosi akayangula, “Yati nikuvagotolela.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Nambu nkosi avagotolili lepi Mefibosheti mwana wa Yonatani na mjukulu wa Sauli, ndava Daudi na Yonatani mwana wa Sauli vavikili lilaganu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Nambu nkosi avatolili Alimoni na Mefibosheti, vana vavili va Lisipa msikana wa Aiya, veamuvelekili Sauli. Mewawa avatolili vana muhanu va Adilieli mwana wa Balizilai mundu kuhuma Mehola. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Vana venavo saba vagosi, Daudi avagotwili kwa Vagibioni na vene vakavakoma cha kuvakungila ku chitumbi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, voha saba vakafwa pamonga. Vana venavo vakomiwi lukumbi lwa kutumbula kubena shayili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Kangi, Lisipa msikana wa Aiya akatola lijafafa, akatandika palitalau. Atamili penapo tangiya pelwatumbwili lukumbi lwa kubena mbaka lukumbi lwa fula pelwahikili na kutonyalela mituhi ya vandu venavo vevakomiwi. Lukumbi lwenulo lwoha avingalilayi videge vya kunani na hinyama ya ku dasi kilu na muhi muni hikotoka kuihikila mituhi yila.<verse eid="2SA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Daudi peayuwini gala geakiti Lisipa msikana wa Aiya, mdala wa kuvala wa Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />akahamba kutola majege ga Sauli na Yonatani mwana waki kuhuma kwa vandu va Yabeshi Gileadi, vevayivili majege genago ku luvanja lwa kukonganekela vandu voha ku Beti Shani, kula Vafilisiti kwevamuyinjisi Sauli na Yonatani ligono lila pevamkomili Sauli ku chitumbi cha Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Hinu Daudi akawuyisa majege ga Sauli na ga mwana waki Yonatani kuhuma kwenuko, kangi vakayola majege ga vana saba vevayinjikwi. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ndi, vandu va Daudi vakagazika majege ga Sauli na ga Yonatani mwana waki ku mulima wa Benjamini, mu litinda la Kishi dadi waki Sauli ku Sela. Vakitili kila chindu chealagizi nkosi. Pagenago, Chapanga akavayuwanila kuyupa kwavi kuvala mulima wavi.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli va Daudi vitovana ngodo na mivandu ga Vafilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Lus 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Kangi Vafilisiti vakahamba kutovana ngondo na Vaisilaeli. Mwene Daudi na vandu vaki vakahelela kutovana navu, ligono lenilo Daudi atotokili neju. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Mmonga wa mivandu mweikemiwa Ishibi Benobu kuhuma mu lukolo lwa Lefai, lavili na mgoha weuvi na utopa wa kilo zidatu na yapinga na ajikungili upanga wamupya mu chiwunu chaki ajovili yati akumkoma Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Nambu Abishai mwana wa Seluya akabwela kumtangatila Daudi. Akamzangila Mfilisiti yula mbaka akamkoma. Hinu vandu vakamlapila Daudi na kujova, “Yati wihamba lepi kangi na tete ku ngondo ndava Vaizilaeli voha vakuhuvalila veve.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Pegamaliki genago, yahumalili kangi ngondo na Vafilisiti ku Gobu. Kwenuko Sibekai kuhuma lukolo lwa Husha, amkomili Safu mweavili mveleku wa mivandu gegakemiwi Valefai.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Vaisilaeli vatovini kavili ngondo na Vafilisiti ku Gobu. Na mwene Elihanani mwana wa Yaale Olegimu mwana wa Yaili kuhuma ku Betelehemu, amkomili Goliati kuhuma ku Gati, na chaka cha mgoha waki chavili chivaha ngati mkongo wa litendegu la chitanda.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Badayi Vaisilaeli vakatovana na Vafilisiti ku Gati, kwavili na limundu litali lelina ngonji sita mu kila chiwoko na ngonji sita mu kila chigendelu, mvalangu wa ngonji zoha zavii ngonji ishilini na mcheche, na mwene mewa ahumalili mu lukolo mivandu gegikemiwa Valefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Limundu lenilo pelavaligili Vaizilaeli, Yonatani mwana wa Shimei, mlongo waki Daudi, akalikoma.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Venavo mcheche vevavili va chiveleku cha mivandu gegikemiwa Valefai va ku Gati, na vene mewa vakomiwi na Daudi pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Lunyimbu lwa kuhotola lwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daudi amyimbili Bambu Chapanga lunyimbu lwenulu ligono lila peamgombwili kuhuma kwa vamakoko vaki, na kuhuma kwa Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 22:1">Akayimba naa,<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Bambu Chapanga ndi litalau langu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">ngome yangu na msangula wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Chapanga wangu ndi litalau langu, pandu penikujihiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">mwene ndi chingwamba changu, na makakala ga usangula wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">ngome yangu na pandu pangu pa kujihiha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Msangula wangu, akunisangula kuhuma kwa vandu vevavili na luhonda.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Nikumkemela Bambu Chapanga mweiganikiwa kulumbiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">na nene nisanguliwa kuhuma kwa makoko vangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Mayuga ga lifwa gavi ganitindili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">mafuliku ga kuhalabisa gavi ganiyolili,<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />nyosi za litinda zanikungili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">mitegu ya lifwa yanikamwili.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mukung'ahika kwangu, namkemili Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">namvembalili Chapanga wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Kuhuma mu nyumba yaki ayuwini lwami lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">chivembu changu chamuhikalili mu makutu gaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Mulima woha wandendimi na kunyugusika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">mikingisa ya kunani yikayugayuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">vandendimi muni Chapanga ayomili.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Lyohi lahukili kuhuma mu meng'elu mwaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">motu weutinisa wahumili mu mlomo waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">makalakala ga motu gayakili mu mlomo mwenumo.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Abaywili kunani, akahuluka pahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">lihundi lititu lavili pahi ya magendelu gaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Akwelili chiumbi chechivi na magwaba na akambuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">ambuluwiki ku nani na magwaba ga upepu.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Ajitindisili chitita pandi zoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">ajigubiki mahundi gatitu ga hula ya kunani.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Ndava ya lumuli lwa kuvya kwaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">mahundi gahegalili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">yikatonya hula ya maganga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">na lumuli lwa mbamba.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Bambu Chapanga abulwimi kuhuma kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">lwami lwa mweavilikunani neju lwayuwaniki.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Ajugumili nduta akavapechenganisa vamakoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">lumuli lwaki lukamulika na kuvajumbisa.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Makemba ga bahali gagubukuliwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">na mikingisa ya mulima yikavya waka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kwa kuywanga kwaki Bambu Chapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kwa lukeku lwelwahumili kwa makakala mu meng'elu zaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Chapanga akagolosa chiwoko chaki kuhuma kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">akanikamula kwa chiwoko chaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">akanihuwula kuhuma pandu pepanyoliki mu manji gamahele.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Anisangwili kuhuma kwa vamakoko vangu vevavi na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">vala vevanivengili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">muni vene vavii na makakala kuliku nene.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Vanizangili mu ligono lenavili mumang'aiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">nambu Bambu Chapanga ndi mweanitangatili.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Aniletili, akanivika pandu pabwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">anisangwili muni aganisiwi na nene.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Bambu Chapanga anikitili kuwanangana na chenayidakiliwi palongolo yaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">animotisi ndava muni navili lepi nambudanu.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Muni niyidakili mihilu yaki Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">nikitili lepi gahakahu kwa kumleka Chapanga wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Nikamwili malagizu gaki goha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">nalekili lepi kukamula mihilu yaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Palongolo yaki navii lepi mbudanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">nijiyangalili nikoto kukita gahakahu.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Bambu Chapanga anipelili njombi kuwanangana na kuyidakiliwa kwangu palongolo yaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">kuwanangana na ubwina wangu palongolo ya mihu gaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Kwa vevavili vasadikika ukujilangisa kuvya msadikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">kwa vevangavya vabudanu ukujilangisa kuvya mwewangabuda.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Veve ndi mbwina kwa vevavi bwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">nambu kwa vabudanu ukujilangisa kuvya veve walikoko wavi.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Mwene akuvasangula vevavi ngolongondi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">nambu akuvalola vevimeka na kuvagwisa.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Veve Bambu Chapanga ndi lumuli lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Bambu Chapanga wangu, mweukunilangasila mu chitita.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kwa utangatila waku, ukunipela makakala ga kuvazangila vamakoko vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">na uhotola wa kukwela luwumba lwavi.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Chapanga akuvalongosa vandu mu njila yeyikamiliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">goha geihaidila Bambu Chapanga ndi gachakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">mwene ndi chingwamba kwa voha vevakujihiha kwaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Ndi yani mweavi ngati Bambu Chapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Yani mweavili litalau la pa kujihiha, nga Chapanga witu.<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Chapanga ndi pandu pangu pepakangamili pa kujihiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">na akugakita matendu gangu gakotoka kunung'unikiwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Akangamalisi magendelu gangu ngati ga hipalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">na kunikita niyima bwina mu hitumbi.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Akuniwula kutovana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">mawoko gangu gahotolayi kupindisa upindi wa shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Unipelili chingwamba chaku cha kunisangula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">utangatila waku ukunikita nivya namkulu.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Ukitili njila yangu yivya yipana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">muni magendeleu gangu gakotoka kutyelela.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Navalandili makoko vangu na kuvakomakesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">nawuyili lepi mumbele mbaka penamalili kuvakoma voha.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Navakomakisi njwee, vahotwili lepi kuyima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">vagwili pahi pa magendelu gangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Wanipelili makakala ga kutovana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">wavakitili vamakoko vangu vafugama na kugundama mu magendelu gangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Wavakitili makoko vangu vang'anamuka na kutila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">na nene nikavakoma vala voha vevanivengayi.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Valondili utangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">nambu vapatili lepi mundu wa kuvasangula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">vakuvembili veve Bambu Chapanga nambu wavayangwili lepi.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Navabondibondili vakavya ngati lububu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">navalivatili ngati madakali ga munjila.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Wanisangwili kuhuma kwa vandu vangu vevanizangili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">unikitili nivya mtalalila wa milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Vandu venavili nangavamanya hinu vakunihengela.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Vayehe vibwela changali kujikwiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">na pevayuwini ndu mambu gangu, vakaniyidakila.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Vayehe vadenyiki mitima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">vahumili mu ngome zavi kuni vindendemeka.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Bambu Chapanga avi mumi! Atopeswa litalawu wangu! Ulumbiwa Chapanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">litalawu la usangula wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Mwene ndi mweakunilipisilila gahakahu kwa vandu vala vevanikitili gahakahu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">mwene ndi mweakuvavika vandu va milima hingi vavya pahi ya utalalila wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Bambu Chapanga anisangwili kuhuma kwa vamakoko vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">aniyinwili panani ya vamakoko vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">na anisangwili kuhuma kwa vandu vevavi na luhonda.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />“Hinu yati nikukulumba veve Bambu Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">pagati ya vandu va milima yati nikulilumba liina laku.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Bambu Chapanga akumpela uhotola ukulu nkosi mweamuhagwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">akumlangisa uganu wewangamalika mwene mweamuhagwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">Daudi na viveleku vyaki vyoha magono goha gangali mwishu.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Malovi ga mwishu ga Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Genaga ndi malovi gakumalikisila ga Daudi. Na ujumbi wa Daudi mwana wa Yese, mundu mweakitiwi kuvya mkulu na yula mweavi kunani, myimbaji wa nyimbu wa Izilaeli mwahaguliwi na Chapanga wa Yakobo.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Mpungu wa Bambu Chapanga ajovili kupitila nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">malovi ganijova gihuma kwaki.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Chapanga wa Isilaeli ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Litalau la Isilaeli anijovili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">“Mundu peakuvatalalila vandu kwa njila yeyidakiliwa kwa nene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Mwaitalalila cha kumtopesa Chapanga<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />Mwene ndi ngati lumuli lwa lukela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">ngati lilanga lelihuma lukela pangali lihundi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">ngati lumuli peyimalika fula yeyimelesa mahamba pandima.”<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Wu vandu va munyumba yangu vahaguliwi lepi na Bambu Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Ena akitili lilaganu la magono goha gangali mwishu na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">yati akulileka lepi lilaganu laki, yati akugakita mambu gangu ganihambila bwina pagati ya goha genikuganogela.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Nambu vandu vahakau, viwanangana na minga yeyitagiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">muni yihotoleka lepi kutola na chiwoko,<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />mundu mweakuhiyola iganikiwa kutumila lyuma amala kwa chaka cha mgoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Na mwene yati akuhiyocha balapala.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli vakekesi va Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Lus 11:10-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Genaga ndi maina ga manjolinjoli vakekesi veavili nawu Daudi, Yoshebi Bashebeti mweahumalili mu lukolo lwa Akimoni mweavili chilongosi wa vala vadatu, mwene akomini kwa mgoha waki, akakoma vandu miya nane kwa lukumbi lumonga.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Kangi mweagelekili pagati ya vala manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu avili Eleazali mwana wa Dodo, wa lukolo lwa Ahohi. Ligono limonga, Eliazali avi pamonga na Daudi peavavaligili Vafilisiti vevakonganiki ku Pasi Damimu kutovana ngondo. Vaisilaeli vavatili Vafilisiti, <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />nambu Eliazali akangamili kutovana na Vafilisiti mbaka chiwoko chaki pechatotokili na kugogodala na kukamulana na upanga waki. Ligono lenilo Bambu Chapanga avakitili vahotola. Kangi Vaisilaeli vawuyili pandu peavili Eliazali na kutola vindu vyevavanyagili Vafilisiti vevakomiwi.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Mkekesi wa datu avili Shama mwana wa Agee kuhuma mulukolo lwa Halali. Vafilisiti vakakonganeka kwenuko ku Lehi, pandu pepavili na mgunda wa dengu zamahele, na Vaisilaeli vavatilili Vafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Nambu Shama ayimili chakukangamala pagati ya mgunda wenuwo muni kuliyangalila, na mwene akavakoma Vafilisiti. Bambu Chapanga akapata uhotola uvaha.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Kangi, manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu vala pagati ya vakulu selasini vakahelela lukumbi lwa mabenu, vakamuhikila Daudi mumbugu ku Adulamu. Lukumbi lwenulo Manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti vavikili kambi yavi ku likemba la Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Lukumbi lwenulo Daudi avili ku ngome na manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti gavii ku muji wa Betelehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi avii na njoto neju akajova, “Ngati ngepivya na mundu ngaanipela manji ga kunywa kuhuma mu chiliva cha Betelehemu chechivili papipi na limlyangu la Muji!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Hinu, manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu vala vakawuka, vakaholota pagati ya kambi ya manjolinjoli ga Vafilisiti vakahamba kunega manji ku chiliva cha Betelehemu, papipi na limlyangu la muji, vakamletela Daudi. Nambu Daudi akabela kunywa pahala paki akagayita palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kuvya luteta lwa mnyweso. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Akajova, “Veve Bambu Chapanga, katu niganikiwa lepi kunywa manji genaga, manji genaga ngasi lepi ya vala vevajiyokisi wumi wavi!” Hinu Daudi anywili lepi manji genago. Mambu genago gevakitili manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu vala.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai mlongo waki Yoabu, mwana wa Seluya, avii mkulu wa manjolinjoli vakekesi selasini. Mwene avatovi vandu miya zidatu kwa mgoha waki na akavakoma kwa ligono limonga, akamanyikana ngati vala manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Abishi avi mwaimanyikana neju pagati ya manjolinjoli vakekesi selasini, na akavya chilongosi wavi, nambu avi lepi pagati ya manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu vala.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, kuhuma ku muji wa Kabizeeli, avi linjolinjoli mkekesi na akitili mambu gamahele gavaha. Avakomili manjolinjoli vakekesi kuliku voha kuhuma ku Moabu. Mewa mulukumbi lwa balafu neju ayingili mulilindi na kukoma lihimba mwenumo. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Mewa alikomili Mmisili mmomga mweavili mtali na mweakulupali, pamonga kuvya Mmisili avi na mgoha mumawoko, Beyana amhambili na chibonga akamyaga mgoha wula, na kumkoma Mmisili kwa mgoha waki mwene. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Beyana, mwana wa Yehoyada akitili genaga, na amanyikini pagati ya manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu vala. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Hinu atopiswi kuliku vala manjolinjoli vakekesi selasini, nambu avikiwi lepi pagati ya manjolinjoli vakekesi vadatu vala. Daudi amkitili avya mkulu wa valonda vaki mwene.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Asheli mlongo waki Yoabu, avi mmonga manjolinjoli vakekesi selasini. Manjolinjoli vangi vakekesi va Daudi vavii, Elihanani mwana Dodo wa ku Betelehemu, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama na Elika voha vahumalili ku Halodi <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi kuhuma ku muji wa Paliti na Ila mwana wa Ikeshi kuhuma ku Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeli kuhuma ku Anatoti na Mebunai kuhuma ku Hushati, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salumoni kuhuma ku Ahohi na Mahalai kuhuma ku Netofahi, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu mwana wa Baana, kuhuma ku Netofati na Itai mwana wa Libai kuhuma ku Gibea mu pandu pevavii Vabenyamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya kuhuma ku Pilatoni na Hidai kuhuma ku vikapela vya papipi na Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialiboni kuhuma ku Alaba na Azimaweti wa kuhuma ku Bahulimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba kuhuma ku Shaaliboni na vana va Yasheni na Yonatani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />na Shama kuhuma ku Halali na Ahimu mwana wa Shalali kuhuma ku muji wa Halali, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />na Elifeleti mwana wa Ahasibai kuhuma ku Maaka na Eliamu mwana wa Ahitofeli kuhuma ku Gilo, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />na Hezilo kuhuma ku Kalimeli na Paalai kuhuma ku Alabi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />na Igali mwana wa Natani kuhuma ku Soba na Bani kuhuma ku Gadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Seleki kuhuma ku Amoni na Nahalai kuhuma ku Beeloti, mweagegayi vindu vya ngondo vya Yoabu mwana wa Seluya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ila na Galebu va kuhuma ku Yatili, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na Ulia wa likabila la Hiti. Voha kwa pamonga vavi manjolinjoli vakekesi va ngondo selasini na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akuvavalanga vandu va Isilaeli na va Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Lus 21:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Bambu Chapanga akavayomela kangi Vaisilaeli, akamkulukisa Daudi kwa kumjovela, “Hamba kavavalanga vandu va Isilaeli na va Yuda.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Hinu nkosi akamlagiza Yoabu, na vakulu va manjolinjoli vevavii pamonga na mwene, “Muhamba mu makabila goha ga Isilaeli kuhumila ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba, mukavayandikisa vandu vevitovana ngondo muni nimanyayi vavili valinga.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Yoabu akamuyangula nkosi, “Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ayonjokesa manjolinjoli mala miya, na mihu ga nkosi, mkulu wangu, galola lijambu lenili. Nambu ndava kyani veve nkosi wangu ugana kukita lijambu ngati lenili?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Nambu lilovi la nkosi lavili na makakala neju kwa Yoabu na vakulu va manjolinjoli. Hinu vakawuka palongolo ya nkosi, vakahamba kuvayandikisa Vaisilaeli voha vevamanyili kutovana ngondo.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Vakayomboka mfuleni Yolodani na kuvika kambi papipi na pandu pepikemiwa Aloeli, kusini ya muji pa ligema la kuhambila ku Gadi kangi vakahamba mbaka ku Yazeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Kangi vakahamba ku Gileadi ku mlima wa Tahitimu Hodeshi mu mulima wa Vahiti. Kangi vakahika ku Dani na kuhuma kwenuo vakatindila kuhamba Sidoni. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Kangi vakahika ku ngome ya muji wa Tilo, vakayingila mu miji yoha ya Vahivi na ya Vakanani. Kangi vakawuka na kuhamba kusini mu mlima wa Yuda mbaka ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Pevamalili kutindila mu mulima woha kwa miyehi tisa na magono ishilini, vawuyili ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yoabu akampela nkosi mvalangu wa vandu vevamanyi kutovana ngondo. Ku Isilaeli kwavili na vandu laki nane vanauhotola wa kutovana ngondo, na ku Yuda vandu laki muhanu.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Nambu Daudi peamali kuvavalanga vandu, ang'aiswi neju mumtima waki. Hinu Daudi akamjovela Bambu Chapanga, “Nibudili neju ndava ya gala genikitili. Nambu hinu nikuyupa veve Bambu Chapanga, unilekekesa nene mtumisi waku, muni nikiti lijambu la uhimu neju.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Chilau yaki Daudi peayimwiki, lilovi la Bambu Chapanga lamuhikili mlota Gadi, mweavili mlolaji wa Daudi, akajova, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Hamba kamjovela naa Daudi, Bambu Chapanga ijova naa, ‘Yati nikupela mibunu hidatu, na veve uhagula mbunu umonga wenikukubuna veve.’” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Hinu Gadi akamuhambila Daudi na kumjovela, “Wu, kuvya na njala ya miyaka saba pa mulima waku? Amala veve uvatila vamakakoko vaku kwa miyehi hidatu kuni vakulandalila? Amala kuvya na matamu gahakahu pa mulima waku kwa magono gadatu? Holalela kangi unijovela nikamyangula mweanitumili.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi akamyangula Gadi, “Nivi mu mang'aisu gavaha neju! Nambu mbanga nibuniwa na Bambu Chapanga muni mwene analipyana, kuliku kubuniwa na vandu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Hinu, Bambu Chapanga akaveletela Vaisilaeli matamu, kuhumila lukela mbaka lukumbu lwelwaganikiwi. Vandu elufu sabini vafwili pa mulima woha kuhumila ku kasikazini ya Dani mbaka kusini ya Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Nambu mtumu wa Chapanga peagolwisi chiwoko chaki muni kuuhalabisa muji wa Yelusalemu, Bambu Chapanga akang'anamusa maholo gaki, akamjovela mtumu yula, mweavakomakesa vandu, “Leka yikolili!” Lukumbi lwenulo mtumu wa Chapanga ayimili papipi na luvanja lwa kupepetela nganu wa Alauna wa likabila la Vayebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi peamuwene mtumu yula mweakoma vandu, akamjovela Bambu Chapanga, “Lola, nene ndi mwenibudili na kukita uhakau wenuwu! Vandu venava vabudili lepi. Chondi nikuyupa neju unibuna nene na vandu va munyumba yangu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Ligono lilolo Gadi akamuhambila Daudi akamjovela, “Kwelayi uhamba ukamjengela Bambu Chapanga pandu pa kuwusila luteta, ku luvanja lwa kupepetela nganu wa Alauna, wa likabila la Vayebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Hinu, Daudi akakwela kuwanangana na lilovi la Gadi ngati Bambu Chapanga chealagizi. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Alauna pealolili upandi wa kunyasi akamuwona nkosi pamonga na vatumisi vaki vakumbwelela, ndi akawuka akahamba kufugama na kugundama mbaka pahi cha utopesa palongolo ya nkosi. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Kangi Alauna akamkota nkosi, “Ndava kyani mkulu wangu nkosi unibwelili nene mtumisi waku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Daudi akamuyangula, “Nibweli kugula luvanja lwaku lwa kupepetela nganu muni nimjengela Bambu Chapanga pandu pa kuwusila luteta muni utamu wenuwu weumala vandu uwukayi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Alauna akamjovela Daudi, “Mkulu wangu nkosi, tola chochoha cheukuchiwona chabwina na umuwusila Bambu Chapanga luteta. Nene niwusa ngo'mbi izi ndava ya luteta lwa kutinyisa na vindu vyenivi vya kupepetela na mangolingoli ga ng'ombi gavya sagala. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Vyenivi vyoha nikupela veve nkosi. Nisadika Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga waku, yati ipokela luteta lwaku lwa kutiniswa.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Nambu nkosi akamjovela Alauna, “Lepi! Veve kotoka kunipela waka chindu chochoha. Nene yati nigula kwaku kwa mashonga gaki. Nihotola lepi kumuwusila Bambu Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, luteta lwa kutinyisa lwa vindu vyenipatili waka.” Hinu, nkosi Daudi akagula luvanja lwa kupepetela nganu na ng'ombi kwa hipandi selasini ya madini ga feza. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Kangi Daudi akamjengela Bambu Chapanga pandu pa kuwusila luteta pa luvanja lwenulwo na kumuwusila luteta lwa kutinyisa na luteta lwa uteke. Hinu, Bambu Chapanga akayangula gala geayupili ndava ya mulima wa Izilaeli, na utamu ula wewavakomayi vandu va Izilaeli ukawuka.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>